INSERT INTO `quote_of_the_day` (`quote_of_the_day_id`, `quote`, `author`, `category`, `time`) VALUES
(3, 'Although golf was originally restricted to wealthy, overweight Protestants, today it''s open to anybody who owns hideous clothing.', 'Dave Barry', 'sports', '2020-07-10 10:22:20'),
(4, 'I don''t have to chase extraordinary moments to find happiness, it''s right in front of me if I''m paying attention and practicing gratitude.', 'Brene Brown', 'life', '2020-07-10 10:22:20'),
(5, 'I''m writing an unauthorized autobiography.', 'Steven Wright', 'funny', '2020-07-10 10:22:20'),
(8, 'Once in a while our school has half days, and the teachers spend the afternoon ''in service,'' which I think must be a group therapy for having to deal with us. ', 'Neal Shusterman', 'students', '2020-07-10 10:22:20'),
(9, 'If you have dreams it is your responsibility to make them happen.', 'Bel Pesce', 'inspire', '2020-07-10 10:22:20'),
(11, 'Have you ever noticed what golf spells backwards?', 'Al Boliska', 'sports', '2020-07-10 10:22:20'),
(12, 'Basically, when you get to my age, you''ll really measure your success in life by how many of the people you want to have love you actually do love you.', 'Warren Buffett', 'life', '2020-07-10 10:22:20'),
(16, 'I tell my students, ''When you get these jobs that you have been so brilliantly trained for, just remember that your real job is that if you are free, you need to free somebody else. If you have some power, then your job is to empower somebody else. This i', 'Toni Morrison', 'students', '2020-07-10 10:22:20'),
(17, 'If you can consciously let yourself get taken and see where you go, that''s an exercise. That''s discipline. To follow the scent. Let yourself go and see what happens, that takes a bit of courage.', 'Bill Murray', 'inspire', '2020-07-10 10:22:20'),
(20, 'In both our personal and professional lives, there are times when reality dictates that we must stand up and ''end'' something. Either its time has passed, its season is over, or worse, continuing it would be destructive in some way.', 'Henry Cloud', 'life', '2020-07-10 10:22:20'),
(21, 'You can handle just about anything that comes at us out on the road with a believable grin, common sense, and whiskey.', 'Bill Murray', 'funny', '2020-07-10 10:22:20'),
(25, 'It isn’t the mountains ahead to climb that wear you out; it’s the pebble in your shoe.', 'Mohamad Ali', 'inspire', '2020-07-10 10:22:20'),
(31, 'I do think there is an important artistic component in what we do. As a technology company I''ve tried to really stress that.', 'Larry Page', 'art', '2020-07-10 10:22:20'),
(32, 'In my day the principal concerns of university students were sex, smoking dope, rioting and learning. Learning was something you did only when the first three weren''t available. ', 'Bill Bryson', 'students', '2020-07-10 10:22:20'),
(85, 'Life is either a daring adventure or nothing.', 'Hellen Keller', 'life', '2020-09-18 04:02:16'),
(83, 'A leader or a man of action in a crisis almost always acts subconsciously and then thinks of the reasons for his action.', 'Jawaharlal Nehru', 'management', '2020-09-18 04:02:15'),
(82, 'I hated every minute of training, but I said, ‘Don’t quit. Suffer now and live the rest of your life as a champion.', 'Mohamad Ali', 'inspire', '2020-09-18 04:02:15'),
(77, 'The second half of a mans life is made up of nothing but the habits he has acquired during the first half.', 'Fyodor Dostoevsky', 'life', '2020-09-17 04:02:12'),
(128, 'It is inevitable that some defeat will enter even the most victorious life. The human spirit is never finished when it is defeated...it is finished when it surrenders.', 'Ben Stein', 'life', '2020-09-20 09:07:39'),
(144, 'Science can make man comfortable, but only wisdom can make man happy.', 'Theodore Hesburgh', 'life', '2020-09-22 04:02:00'),
(146, '"Theres too much risk in loving."  the young boy said. "No" said the old man. "Theres too much risk in not"', 'Atticus', 'love', '2020-09-22 04:02:00'),
(149, 'If you respect yourself in stressful situations, it will help you see the positive… It will help you see the message in the mess.', 'Steve Maraboli', 'inspire', '2020-09-23 04:02:11'),
(165, 'Whether you think you can or think you can’t, you’re right....', 'Henry Ford', 'inspire', '2020-09-26 04:01:55'),
(168, 'Its a wonderful thing to be optimistic. It keeps you healthy and it keeps you resilient.', 'Daniel Kahneman', 'life', '2020-09-26 04:01:56'),
(171, '“Wine making is an artistic creation in which you deal with a variety of styles, colors, and inspiration therefore good wine, like good art, can evoke emotions, sensations and create an experience which leaves a lasting impression.” ', 'Giovanni Morassutti', 'art', '2020-09-26 04:01:57'),
(178, 'Fathers and mothers, if you have children, they must come first. You must read to your children and you must hug your children and you must love your children. Your success as a family, our success as a society, depends not on what happens in the White Ho', 'Barbara Bush', 'love', '2020-09-27 04:02:49'),
(197, 'The beginning of freedom is the realization that you are not the possessing entity the thinker.', 'Eckhart Tolle', 'inspire', '2020-09-30 04:03:01'),
(198, 'Men make history, and not the other way around.  In periods where there is no leadership, society stands still.  Progress occurs when courageous, skillful leaders seize the opportunity to change things for the better.', 'Harry S Truman', 'management', '2020-09-30 04:03:01'),
(205, 'Ideas are these disembodied life forms, they dont have a form, but they have a will. All they want is to be made manifest. If you can manage to open up your consciousness to an idea of living in a world of abundance, then you can believe that, constantly,', 'Elizabeth Gilbert', 'inspire', '2020-10-01 04:02:14'),
(208, '...not doing what we love in the name of greed is very poor management of our lives.', 'Warren Buffett', 'life', '2020-10-01 04:02:14'),
(221, 'Do not wait to strike till the iron is hot; but make it hot by striking....', 'William B. Sprague', 'inspire', '2020-10-03 04:02:13'),
(237, 'Life is like a camera: just focus on what is important, capture good times, develop from negative, and if things do not work out, take another shot!', 'Daireth Winehouse', 'inspire', '2020-10-05 04:02:13'),
(238, 'Who is the bravest hero? He who turns his enemy into a friend', 'Hebrew Proverb', 'management', '2020-10-05 04:02:13'),
(245, 'Every day you have a choice to be honest or deceptive. If you commit to telling the truth, you will win. You’ll win more trust, you’ll win more business, and you’ll win more peace of mind. You’ll break the system and be even more successful.', 'Dale Patridge', 'inspire', '2020-10-06 04:02:40'),
(248, 'You cant really be strong until you see a funny side to things.', 'Ken Kesey', 'life', '2020-10-06 04:02:40'),
(249, 'I bought a new Japanese car, I turned on the radio ... I dont understand a word theyre saying.', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2020-10-06 04:02:41'),
(254, 'Effective leadership is not about making speeches or being liked leadership is defined by results not attributes.', 'Peter Drucker', 'management', '2020-10-07 04:02:30'),
(257, 'You know how it is when youre reading a book and falling asleep, youre reading, reading... and all of a sudden you notice your eyes are closed? Im like that all the time.', 'Steven Wright', 'funny', '2020-10-07 04:02:30'),
(258, 'Can miles truly separate you from friends... If you want to be with someone you love, arent you already there?', 'Richard Bach', 'love', '2020-10-07 04:02:31'),
(259, '“Creating the kind of connections between people that lead to collective civic action, political expression, community dialogue, shared cultural experiences.” ', 'Giovanni Morassutti', 'art', '2020-10-07 04:02:31'),
(264, 'The secret of success in life is for a man to be ready for his opportunity when it comes.', 'Benjamin Disraeli', 'life', '2020-10-08 04:02:20'),
(267, 'When I am finishing a picture, I hold some Godmade object up to it  a rock, a flower, the branch of a tree or my hand  as a final test. If the painting stands up beside a thing man cannot make, the painting is authentic. If theres a clash between the two,', 'Marc Chagall', 'art', '2020-10-08 04:02:20'),
(282, 'Meaning is something you build into your life. You build it out of your own past, out of your affections and loyalties, out of the experience of humankind as it is passed on to you. ... You are the only one who can put them together into that unique patte', 'John Gardner', 'inspire', '2020-10-11 04:02:07'),
(284, 'Fishing... is a sport invented by insects and you are the bait.', 'P. J. ORourke', 'sports', '2020-10-11 04:02:08'),
(285, 'You can map your life through your favorite movies, and no two peoples maps will be the same.', 'Mary Schmich', 'life', '2020-10-11 04:02:08'),
(290, 'A show of confidence raises the bar', 'Lorii Myers', 'inspire', '2020-10-12 04:02:21'),
(303, 'The best proof of love is trust.', 'Joyce Brothers', 'love', '2020-10-13 04:02:13'),
(307, 'You shouldnt do things differently just because theyre different. They need to be... better.', 'Elon Musk', 'management', '2020-10-14 04:02:01'),
(309, 'You only have to do a very few things right in your life so long as you dont do too many things wrong.', 'Warren Buffett', 'life', '2020-10-14 04:02:01'),
(314, 'When it comes to winning, you need the skill and the will.', 'Frank Tyger', 'inspire', '2020-10-15 04:02:11'),
(318, 'Because I bought it on sale I actually made money.', 'Shopper Extraordinaire', 'funny', '2020-10-15 04:02:12'),
(319, 'Love is only a dirty trick played on us to achieve continuation of the species.', 'W. Somerset Maugham', 'love', '2020-10-15 04:02:12'),
(334, 'The trouble with being punctual is that nobodys there to appreciate it.', 'Franklin P.  Jones', 'funny', '2020-10-17 04:02:14'),
(338, 'One does not accumulate but eliminate .\r\nIt is not daily increase but daily\r\ndecrease. The height of cultivation\r\nalways runs to simplicity.', 'Bruce Lee', 'inspire', '2020-10-18 04:02:15'),
(341, 'I was sitting on the bus, and the sign said if youre ready to better your life, come to Medgar Evers College, and I got off the bus and went to Medgar Evers College.', 'Iyanla Vanzant', 'life', '2020-10-18 04:02:15'),
(346, 'You defeated me But you wont defeat me again Because you have grown all you can grow.... but I am still growing (about Mount Everest).', 'Edmund Hillary', 'inspire', '2020-10-19 04:01:56'),
(347, 'The leader is one who mobilizes others toward a goal shared by leaders and followers... Leaders, followers and goals make up the three equally necessary supports for leadership.', 'Gary Wills', 'management', '2020-10-19 04:01:57'),
(349, 'To whom much is given, much is expected. I do believe this. Its embedded in me.', 'Tim Cook', 'life', '2020-10-19 04:01:57'),
(363, 'Leadership is a combination of strategy and character. If you must be without one, be without the strategy.', 'Gen. H. Norman Schwarzkopf', 'management', '2020-10-21 04:02:01'),
(369, 'I’ve never left the field saying, ‘I could have done more to get ready.’ And that gives me peace of mind.', 'Peyton Manning', 'sports', '2020-10-22 04:02:22'),
(375, 'We hold ourselves back in ways both big and small, by lacking self-confidence, by not raising our hands, and by pulling back when we should be leaning in.', 'Sheryl Sandberg', 'inspire', '2020-10-23 04:03:03'),
(380, 'My purpose is to teach and demonstrate what is possible. To demonstrate love of God and good. Remember what my role is as a woman: to be... good. My role as a mother: to teach, support and nurture my offspring. My role as a grandmother: to remind everybod', 'Iyanla Vanzant', 'love', '2020-10-23 04:03:04'),
(390, 'I also believe that academic freedom should protect the right of a professor or student to advocate Marxism, socialism, communism, or any other minority viewpoint-no matter how distasteful to the majority, provided...', 'Richard M. Nixon', 'students', '2020-10-24 04:02:14'),
(392, 'When the leadership is right and the time is right, the people can always be counted upon to follow to the end at all costs.', 'Harold J. Seymour', 'management', '2020-10-25 05:02:16'),
(394, 'Preparation for old age should begin not later than ones teens. A life which is empty of purpose until 65 will not suddenly become filled on retirement.', 'Dwight L. Moody', 'life', '2020-10-25 05:02:16'),
(399, 'Keep a positive mind. Remember, a failed attempt doesnt make you a failure—giving up does.', 'Lorii Myers', 'inspire', '2020-10-26 05:02:13'),
(410, 'Mans main task in life is to give birth to himself, to become what he potentially is. The most important product of his effort is his own personality.', 'Erich Fromm', 'life', '2020-10-27 05:02:08'),
(412, 'You dont have to go looking for love when its where you come from.', 'Werner Erhard', 'love', '2020-10-27 05:02:09'),
(415, 'Dont be tempted to break momentum—work through it.', 'Lorii Myers', 'inspire', '2020-10-28 05:01:51'),
(431, 'Remember that you are very special,no one can play your role better than you.', 'Damayanti Patra', 'inspire', '2020-10-30 05:02:08'),
(432, 'A leader has to lead, or otherwise he has no business in politics.', 'Harry S Truman', 'management', '2020-10-30 05:02:08'),
(433, 'I enjoy now doing what I do... playing golf, relaxing a little, enjoying life.', 'Yogi Berra', 'sports', '2020-10-30 05:02:09'),
(442, 'Life is like a music. Just go with the flow, enjoy the rhythm.. feel the beat.', 'Leona Salarda', 'life', '2020-10-31 05:02:21'),
(452, 'Hallow the body as a temple to comeliness and sanctify the heart as a sacrifice to love; love recompenses the adorers.', 'Kahlil Gibran', 'love', '2020-11-01 05:02:04'),
(455, 'If you like what you do, and you’re lucky enough to be good at it, do it for that reason.', 'Phil Grimshaw', 'inspire', '2020-11-02 05:02:07'),
(458, 'People say Ive had a difficult time in life. I think Ive had an exciting time in life.', 'Iyanla Vanzant', 'life', '2020-11-02 05:02:08'),
(462, 'Today is not just another ordinary day. It is an opportunity to do, or say, something that just might inspire someone to greater becoming...especially a wayward youth. ', 'T.F. Hodge', 'students', '2020-11-02 05:02:09'),
(466, 'God writes a lot of comedy... the trouble is, hes stuck with so many bad actors who dont know how to play funny.', 'Garrison Keillor', 'life', '2020-11-03 05:01:46'),
(470, 'Do question, even the basics!You will be a fool for once!If you dont, you will be, for a lifetime..', 'Himmilicious', 'students', '2020-11-03 05:01:47'),
(482, 'A culture is like an immune system. It operates through the laws of systems, just like a body. If a body has an infection, the immune system deals with it. Similarly, a group enforces its norms, either actively or passively.', 'Henry Cloud', 'life', '2020-11-05 05:02:07'),
(484, 'It is easier to love humanity as a whole than to love ones neighbor.', 'Eric Hoffer', 'love', '2020-11-05 05:02:08'),
(490, 'The problem with the world is that the intelligent people are full of doubts, while the stupid ones are full of confidence.', 'Charles Bukowski', 'life', '2020-11-06 05:02:10'),
(495, 'There is no one right way. Just figure out what works for you!', 'Lorii Myers', 'inspire', '2020-11-07 05:01:53'),
(519, 'Regardless of how you feel inside, always try to look like a winner. Even if you are behind, a sustained look of control and confidence can give you a mental edge that results in victory.', 'Arthur Ashe', 'inspire', '2020-11-10 05:02:03'),
(538, 'Attention to health is lifes greatest hindrance.', 'Plato', 'life', '2020-11-12 05:01:58'),
(548, 'Love lives on hope, and dies when hope is dead It is a flame which sinks for lack of fuel.', 'Charles Caleb Colton', 'love', '2020-11-13 05:01:48'),
(551, 'Dont be afraid of losing, be afraid of playing a game and not learning something.', 'Dan Heisman', 'inspire', '2020-11-14 05:02:06'),
(555, 'You are graduating from college. That means that this is the first day of the last day of your life. No, thats wrong. This is the last day of the first day of school. Nope, thats worse. This is a day.', 'Andy Samberg', 'funny', '2020-11-14 05:02:07'),
(559, 'If you get up in the morning and think the future is going to be better, it is a bright day. Otherwise, its not.', 'Elon Musk', 'inspire', '2020-11-15 05:01:45'),
(562, 'It is the ability to take a joke, not make one, that proves you have a sense of humor.', 'Max Eastman', 'life', '2020-11-15 05:01:46'),
(575, 'Excellence prospers in the absence of excuses.', 'Lorii Myers', 'inspire', '2020-11-17 05:02:09'),
(576, 'Communication is the real work of leadership.', 'Nitin Nohria', 'management', '2020-11-17 05:02:10'),
(591, 'I dont believe in an afterlife, so I dont have to spend my whole life fearing hell, or fearing heaven even more. For whatever the tortures of hell, I think the boredom of heaven would be even worse.', 'Isaac Asimov', 'life', '2020-11-19 05:01:42'),
(597, 'Leadership is unlocking peoples potential to become better.', 'Bill Bradley', 'management', '2020-11-20 05:02:15'),
(607, 'A person starts to live when he can live outside himself.', 'Albert Einstein', 'life', '2020-11-21 05:01:47'),
(612, 'The man who has confidence in himself gains the confidence of others.', 'Hasidic Proverb', 'inspire', '2020-11-22 05:02:08'),
(613, 'Leadership development is not an event.', 'John G Agno', 'management', '2020-11-22 05:02:08'),
(616, 'Plain women are always jealous of their husbands. Beautiful women never are. They are always so occupied with being jealous of other womens husbands.', 'Oscar Wilde', 'funny', '2020-11-22 05:02:09'),
(623, 'Some peoples developmental path has not equipped them to stand up and let go of something.', 'Henry Cloud', 'life', '2020-11-23 05:02:03'),
(644, 'Plant your own garden and decorate your own soul, instead of waiting for someone to bring you flowers.', 'Veronica A. Shoffstall', 'inspire', '2020-11-26 05:02:13'),
(645, 'When a management team with a reputation for brilliance tackles a business with a reputation for bad economics, it is the reputation of the business that remains intact.', 'Warren Buffett', 'management', '2020-11-26 05:02:14'),
(647, 'An eye for eye only ends up making the whole world blind..', 'M.K. Gandhi', 'life', '2020-11-26 05:02:14'),
(652, 'The journey of a thousand miles begins with one step.', 'Lao Tzu', 'inspire', '2020-11-27 05:02:03'),
(663, 'Character develops itself in the stream of life.', 'Johann Wolfgang von Goethe', 'life', '2020-11-28 05:02:11'),
(669, 'A leader is best when people barely know he exists, when his work is done, his aim fulfilled, they will say: We did it ourselves.', 'Lao Tzu', 'management', '2020-11-29 05:02:06'),
(679, 'I had to stop traveling alone because I missed so many planes. When somebody runs up to you in the airport and begins to tell you their life story, you cant say, Excuse me, boo, as theyre weeping on your bosom.', 'Iyanla Vanzant', 'life', '2020-11-30 05:02:07'),
(689, 'A man in love is incomplete until he has married. Then hes finished.', 'Zsa Zsa Gabor', 'love', '2020-12-01 05:02:05'),
(695, 'Each player must accept the cards life deals him or her: but once they are in hand, he or she alone must decide how to play the cards in order to win the game.', 'Voltaire', 'life', '2020-12-02 05:02:04'),
(697, 'Food, love, career, and mothers, the four major guilt groups.', 'Cathy Guisewite', 'love', '2020-12-02 05:02:04'),
(703, 'Too often we underestimate the power of a touch, a smile, a kind word, a listening ear, an honest compliment, or the smallest act of caring, all of which have the potential to turn a life around.', 'Leo Buscaglia', 'life', '2020-12-03 05:02:12'),
(711, 'Dont count the days; make the days count.', 'Mohamad Ali', 'life', '2020-12-04 05:01:49'),
(724, 'Many of lifes failures are experienced by people who did not realize how close they were to success when they gave up.', 'Thomas Edison', 'inspire', '2020-12-06 05:01:41'),
(727, 'In between goals is a thing called life, that has to be lived and enjoyed.', 'Sid Caesar', 'life', '2020-12-06 05:01:42'),
(728, 'Business underlies everything in our national life, including our spiritual life. Witness the fact that in the Lords Prayer, the first petition is for daily bread. No one can worship God or love his neighbor on an empty stomach.', 'Woodrow Wilson', 'funny', '2020-12-06 05:01:42'),
(732, 'Hang Out with People Who are Better than You.', 'Warren Buffett', 'inspire', '2020-12-07 05:02:03'),
(733, 'There are many elements to a campaign. Leadership is number one. Everything else is number two.', 'Bernd Brecher', 'management', '2020-12-07 05:02:03'),
(740, 'It isnt the mountains ahead to climb that wear you out; its the pebble in your shoe.', 'Mohamad Ali', 'inspire', '2020-12-08 05:02:01'),
(761, 'Love seems the swiftest, but it is the slowest of growths. No man or woman really knows what perfect love is until they have been married a quarter of a century.', 'Mark Twain', 'love', '2020-12-10 05:02:15'),
(769, 'What is uttered from the heart alone, Will win the hearts of others to your own.', 'Johann Wolfgang von Goethe', 'love', '2020-12-11 05:02:05'),
(780, 'Let our advance worrying become advance thinking and planning.', 'Winston Churchill', 'inspire', '2020-12-13 05:02:24'),
(783, 'Theres no difference between a pessimist who says, "Oh, its hopeless, so dont bother doing anything", and an optimist who says, "Dont bother doing anything, its going to turn out fine anyway". Either way, nothing happens.', 'Yvon Chouinard', 'life', '2020-12-13 05:02:24'),
(791, 'We make a living by what we get, but we make a life by what we give.', 'Winston Churchill', 'life', '2020-12-14 05:02:20'),
(792, 'When I was a kid I used to pray every night for a new bicycle. Then I realised that the Lord doesnt work that way so I stole one and asked Him to forgive me.', 'Emo Philips', 'funny', '2020-12-14 05:02:20'),
(805, 'We need not just a new generation of leadership but a new gender of leadership', 'Bill Clinton', 'management', '2020-12-16 05:02:15'),
(825, 'Do not worry if you have built your castles in the air. They are where they should be. Now put the foundations under them.', 'Henry David Thoreau', 'inspire', '2020-12-19 05:02:08'),
(828, 'Closed systems run down and get more chaotic over time. Always get better by being open to outside energy and templates of better ways to function.', 'Henry Cloud', 'life', '2020-12-19 05:02:09'),
(838, 'When all is said and done, the weather and love are the two elements about which one can never be sure.', 'Alice Hoffman', 'love', '2020-12-20 05:02:09'),
(849, 'You either walk inside your story and own it or you stand outside your story and hustle for your worthiness.', 'Brene Brown', 'inspire', '2020-12-22 05:02:04'),
(866, 'A person, who no matter how desperate the situation, gives others hope, is a true leader.', 'Daisaku Ikeda', 'management', '2020-12-24 05:02:15'),
(870, 'Love is friendship set on fire.', 'Jeremy   Taylor', 'love', '2020-12-24 05:02:16'),
(873, 'Let us think the unthinkable, let us do the undoable, let us prepare to grapple with the ineffable itself, and see if we may not eff it after all.', 'Douglas Adams', 'inspire', '2020-12-25 05:03:14'),
(892, 'Go confidently in the direction of your dreams. Live the life youve imagined. As you simplify your life, the laws of the universe will be simpler.', 'Henry David Thoreau', 'life', '2020-12-27 05:02:35'),
(894, 'If you cannot do great things, do small things in a great way.', 'Napoleon Hill', 'inspire', '2020-12-28 05:02:16'),
(898, 'A little sincerity is a dangerous thing, and a great deal of it is absolutely fatal.', 'Oscar Wilde', 'funny', '2020-12-28 05:02:17'),
(900, 'Photograph: a picture painted by the sun without instruction in art.', 'Ambrose Bierce', 'art', '2020-12-28 05:02:17'),
(911, 'Theres a tremendous bias against taking risks. Everyone is trying to optimize their ass-covering.', 'Elon Musk', 'management', '2020-12-30 05:02:05'),
(915, 'First love is only a little foolishness and a lot of curiosity.', 'George Bernard Shaw', 'love', '2020-12-30 05:02:06'),
(919, 'Dont necessarily avoid sharp edges. Occasionally they are necessary to leadership.', 'Donald Rumsfeld', 'management', '2020-12-31 05:01:59'),
(920, 'You spend a good piece of your life gripping a baseball and in the end it turns out that it was the other way around all the time.', 'Jim Bouton', 'sports', '2020-12-31 05:01:59'),
(929, 'Your time is limited, so dont waste it living someone elses life. Dont be trapped by dogma - which is living with the results of other peoples thinking. Dont let the noise of others opinions drown out your own inner voice. And most important, have the cou', 'Steve Jobs', 'life', '2021-01-01 05:02:25'),
(942, 'Core passions and aspirations should be consistent and in sync.', 'Lorii Myers', 'inspire', '2021-01-03 05:02:00'),
(943, 'A leader needs enough understanding to fashion an intelligent strategy.', 'John Kotter', 'management', '2021-01-03 05:02:00'),
(961, 'Life is half spent before we know what it is.', 'George Herbert', 'life', '2021-01-05 05:03:13'),
(963, 'For Mercy has a human heart, Pity, a human face, And Love, the human form divine, And Peace, the human dress.', 'William Blake', 'love', '2021-01-05 05:03:13'),
(972, 'One of the dangers of the American artist is that he finds himself almost exclusively thrown in with persons more or less in the arts. He lives among them, eats among them, quarrels with them, marries them.', 'Thornton Wilder', 'art', '2021-01-06 05:02:17'),
(974, 'I hated every minute of training, but I said, Dont quit. Suffer now and live the rest of your life as a champion.', 'Mohamad Ali', 'inspire', '2021-01-07 05:02:17'),
(982, 'Win any way as long as you can get away with it. Nice guys finish last.', 'Leo Durocher', 'inspire', '2021-01-08 05:02:10'),
(983, 'Business isnt done on a spreadsheet, done between people. Developing, building and nurturing relationships matter.', 'Sanjay Anandaram', 'management', '2021-01-08 05:02:11'),
(990, 'Where there is ruin, there is hope for a treasure.', 'Rumi', 'inspire', '2021-01-09 05:01:52'),
(1009, 'Our mind is all weve got. Not that it wont lead us astray sometimes, but we still have to analyze things out within ourselves.', 'Bobby Fischer', 'life', '2021-01-11 05:02:16'),
(1010, 'If at first you dont succeed, try, try again. Then quit. No use being a damn fool about it.', 'W.C. Fields', 'funny', '2021-01-11 05:02:16'),
(1014, 'Many a false step was made by standing still.', 'Fortune Cookie', 'inspire', '2021-01-12 05:02:12'),
(1016, 'Those who know how to win are much more numerous than those who know how to make proper use of their victories', 'Polybius', 'inspire', '2021-01-13 05:01:55'),
(1021, 'If you have love you dont need to have anything else. If you dont have it it doesnt matter much what else you do have.', 'James M. Barrie', 'love', '2021-01-13 05:01:56'),
(1028, 'My wifes not too smart. I told her our kids were spoiled. She said, all kids smell that way.', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2021-01-14 05:02:18'),
(1029, 'When you say you are in love with humanity, you are well satisfied with yourself.', 'Luigi Pirandello', 'love', '2021-01-14 05:02:18'),
(1041, 'All of the great leaders have had one characteristic in common: it was the willingness to confront unequivocally the major anxiety of their people in their time. This, and not much else, is the essence of leadership.', 'John Kenneth Galbraith', 'management', '2021-01-16 05:02:13'),
(1048, 'You defeated me But you wont defeat me again Because you have grown all you can grow.. But I am still growing (about Mount Everest).', 'Edmund Hillary', 'inspire', '2021-01-17 05:02:06'),
(1051, 'God writes a lot of comedy.. The trouble is, hes stuck with so many bad actors who dont know how to play funny.', 'Garrison Keillor', 'life', '2021-01-17 05:02:07'),
(1064, 'Own 100 percent of your focus. The most challenging of endurance drills will bring you to a level of optimal mental and physical performance.', 'Lorii Myers', 'inspire', '2021-01-19 05:02:10'),
(1067, 'Never regret. If its good, its wonderful. If its bad, its experience.', 'Victoria Holt', 'life', '2021-01-19 05:02:11'),
(1083, 'The secret is to have a sense of yourself, your real self, your unique self.', 'Bill Murray', 'life', '2021-01-21 05:02:07'),
(1084, 'I put instant coffee in a microwave oven and almost went back in time.', 'Steven Wright', 'funny', '2021-01-21 05:02:08'),
(1088, 'Think ahead. Dont let day-to-day operations drive out planning.', 'Donald Rumsfeld', 'inspire', '2021-01-22 05:01:56'),
(1089, 'No amount of study or learning will make a man a leader unless he has the natural qualities of one.', 'Archibald Wavell', 'management', '2021-01-22 05:01:56'),
(1094, 'When you make the U-turn to the Universal Presence and apply the Universal practices and principles, your life is changed.', 'Michael Bernard Beckwith', 'life', '2021-01-23 05:02:08'),
(1096, 'All courses of action are risky, so prudence is not in avoiding danger (its impossible), but calculating risk and acting decisively. Make mistakes of ambition and not mistakes of sloth. Develop the strength to do bold things, not the strength to suffer.', 'Niccolo Machiavelli', 'inspire', '2021-01-24 05:02:24'),
(1112, 'Man needs his difficulties because they are necessary to enjoy success.', 'A. P. J. Abdul Kalam', 'inspire', '2021-01-26 05:02:17'),
(1131, 'Life is not an exact science, it is an art.', 'Samuel  Butler', 'life', '2021-01-28 05:02:11'),
(1133, 'Love does not dominate; it cultivates.', 'Johann Wolfgang von Goethe', 'love', '2021-01-28 05:02:11'),
(1137, 'Without values, the multinational manager may forget that foreign profit without indigenous development in that country is a formula for economic and political disaster, at home as well as abroad.', 'Theodore Hesburgh', 'management', '2021-01-29 05:02:13'),
(1141, 'You never understand anybody that loves you.', 'Ernest Hemingway', 'love', '2021-01-29 05:02:14'),
(1144, 'You must have a positive self perception in order to transcend anything.', 'Steve Maraboli', 'inspire', '2021-01-30 05:02:05'),
(1156, 'A James Cagney love scene is one where he lets the other guy live.', 'Bob Hope', 'funny', '2021-01-31 05:02:05'),
(1161, 'The leader is one who mobilizes others toward a goal shared by leaders and followers.. Leaders, followers and goals make up the three equally necessary supports for leadership.', 'Gary Wills', 'management', '2021-02-01 05:02:08'),
(1163, 'I want to be in the arena. I want to be brave with my life. And when we make the choice to dare greatly, we sign up to get our asses kicked. We can choose courage or we can choose comfort, but we cant have both. Not at the same time.', 'Brene Brown', 'life', '2021-02-01 05:02:08'),
(1168, 'Winners lose much more often than losers. So if you keep losing but youre still trying, keep it up! You.. Re right on track.', 'Matthew Keith Groves', 'inspire', '2021-02-02 05:02:01'),
(1177, 'A company is a group organized to create a product or service, and it is only as good as its people and how excited they are about creating. I do want to recognize a ton of super-talented people. I just happen to be the face of the companies.', 'Elon Musk', 'management', '2021-02-03 05:02:09'),
(1185, 'The fear of life is the favorite disease of the 20th century.', 'William Lyon Phelps', 'funny', '2021-02-04 05:02:08'),
(1190, 'Leadership is an unbelievably hard communications job.', 'Paul Danos', 'management', '2021-02-05 05:02:14'),
(1194, 'Treasure the love you receive above all. It will survive long after your good health has vanished.', 'Og Mandino', 'love', '2021-02-05 05:02:15'),
(1205, 'It wasnt raining when Noah built the ark..', 'Howard Ruff', 'inspire', '2021-02-07 05:02:04'),
(1216, 'I sent one e-mail in my life. I sent it to Jeff Raikes at Microsoft, and it ended up in court in Minneapolis, so I am one for one.', 'Warren Buffett', 'life', '2021-02-08 05:02:15'),
(1218, 'You cannot be lonely if you like the person youre alone with.', 'Wayne Dyer', 'love', '2021-02-08 05:02:16'),
(1232, 'I have this theory about performers who last for a long time, and that is, if you break it down, music is not as big a part of it as personality and who you are. I think that we are all 3 people. I am who I think I am, I am who you think I am, and I am wh', 'Kenny Rogers', 'life', '2021-02-10 05:02:08'),
(1235, 'One should either be a work of art, or wear a work of art.', 'Oscar Wilde', 'art', '2021-02-10 05:02:09'),
(1240, 'If our lives in education have any meaning or significance, it will be in our reading the signs of the times and in educating the young of our times in the visions and values that will civilize and make for reasonable human progress and lasting peace on e', 'Theodore Hesburgh', 'life', '2021-02-11 05:02:19'),
(1256, 'In both our personal and professional lives, there are times when reality dictates that we must stand up and end something. Either its time has passed, its season is over, or worse, continuing it would be destructive in some way.', 'Henry Cloud', 'life', '2021-02-16 05:02:17'),
(1262, 'The first responsibility of a leader is to define reality. The last is to say thank you. In between, the leader is a servant.', 'Max De Pree', 'management', '2021-02-17 05:02:06'),
(1280, 'Be not afraid of life. Believe that life IS worth living and your belief will help create the fact.', 'James Truslow Adams', 'life', '2021-02-19 05:02:05'),
(1294, 'The key to successful leadership today is influence, not authority.', 'Kenneth Hartley Blanchard', 'management', '2021-02-21 05:01:56'),
(1298, 'Love makes your soul crawl out from its hiding place.', 'Zora Neale Hurston', 'love', '2021-02-21 05:01:57'),
(1312, 'What a blessing that God allows a life to come through your body, and then allows you to place that body in a body bag and take it out. I had to say that theres a magnificent something that God has for me to do, to give me that level of completion. That l', 'Iyanla Vanzant', 'life', '2021-02-23 05:01:55'),
(1314, 'Respect was invented to cover the empty place where love should be.', 'Leo Tolstoy', 'love', '2021-02-23 05:01:55'),
(1317, 'When you recover or discover something that nourishes your soul and brings joy, care enough about yourself to make room for it in your life.', 'Jean Shinoda Bolen', 'inspire', '2021-02-24 05:02:22'),
(1320, 'One of the things you will find, which is interesting and people dont think of it enough, with most businesses and with most individuals, life tends to snap you at your weakest link. So it isnt the strongest link youre looking for among the individuals in', 'Warren Buffett', 'life', '2021-02-24 05:02:23'),
(1328, 'A master in the art of living draws no sharp distinction between his work and his play; his labor and his leisure; his mind and his body; his education & his recreation. He hardly knows which is which. He simply pursues his vision of excellence through wh', 'François-René de Chateaubriand', 'life', '2021-02-25 05:02:15'),
(1330, 'I dont think anyone can DO anything that would make him worthy of love. Love is a gift and cannot be earned. It can only be given.', 'Real Live Preacher', 'love', '2021-02-25 05:02:16'),
(1344, 'About all you can do in life is be who you are. Some people will love you for you. Most will love you for what you can do for them, and some wont like you at all.', 'Rita Mae Brown', 'life', '2021-02-27 05:02:07'),
(1349, 'If you want to make your dreams come true, the first thing you have to do is wake up.', 'J.M. Power', 'inspire', '2021-03-01 05:02:06'),
(1350, 'When the tyrant has disposed of foreign enemies by conquest or treaty and there is nothing to fear from them, then he is always stirring up some war or other, in order that the people may require a leader.', 'Plato', 'management', '2021-03-01 05:02:06'),
(1365, 'If we ever stop thinking about the person we want to become, we stop learning and taking risks.', 'Sally Blount', 'inspire', '2021-03-03 05:02:06'),
(1370, 'I forgot to shake hands and be friendly. It was an important lesson about leadership.', 'Lee Iacocca', 'management', '2021-03-04 05:02:24'),
(1378, 'A leader is one who knows the way, goes the way, and shows the way.', 'John C. Maxwell', 'management', '2021-03-05 05:02:15'),
(1380, 'Society is like a large piece of frozen water; and skating well is the great art of social life.', 'Letitia Elizabeth Landon', 'life', '2021-03-05 05:02:16'),
(1382, 'No two people really know each other before marriage because it takes about seven years to know each other, another seven to understand each other, another seven to live with each other and another seven to enjoy each other.', 'Yogi Bhajan', 'love', '2021-03-05 05:02:16'),
(1385, 'I think its very important to have a feedback loop, where youre constantly thinking about what youve done and how you could be doing it better. I think thats the single best piece of advice: constantly think about how you could be doing things better and ', 'Elon Musk', 'inspire', '2021-03-06 05:02:07'),
(1388, 'You should take the approach that youre wrong. Your goal is to be less wrong.', 'Elon Musk', 'life', '2021-03-06 05:02:07'),
(1394, 'Great leadership does not mean running away from reality. Sometimes the hard truths might just demoralize the company, but at other times sharing difficulties can inspire people to take action that will make the situation better.', 'John Kotter', 'management', '2021-03-07 05:02:07'),
(1396, 'The plague of man is boasting of his knowledge.', 'Michel de Montaigne', 'life', '2021-03-07 05:02:08'),
(1398, 'We all become great explorers during our first few days in a new city, or a new love affair.', 'Mignon McLaughlin', 'love', '2021-03-07 05:02:08'),
(1402, 'The simple act of paying positive attention to people has a great deal to do with productivity', 'Tom Peters', 'management', '2021-03-08 05:01:52'),
(1404, 'Of all the paths you take in life, make sure a few of them are dirt.', 'John Muir', 'life', '2021-03-08 05:01:53'),
(1412, 'I believe life is a series of near misses. A lot of what we ascribe to luck is not luck at all. Its seizing the day and accepting responsibility for your future. Its seeing what other people dont see And pursuing that vision.', 'Howard Schultz', 'life', '2021-03-09 05:02:13'),
(1413, 'Every morning I get up and look through the Forbes list of the richest people in America. If Im not there, I go to work.', 'Robert Orben', 'funny', '2021-03-09 05:02:14'),
(1422, 'The greatest healing therapy is friendship and love.', 'Hubert Humphrey', 'love', '2021-03-10 05:03:35'),
(1433, 'What you do speaks so loudly that I cannot hear what you say.', 'Ralph Waldo Emerson', 'inspire', '2021-03-12 05:02:06'),
(1434, 'There is no such thing as a minor lapse of integrity', 'Tom Peters', 'management', '2021-03-12 05:02:06'),
(1442, 'Enduring setbacks while maintaining the ability to show others the way to go forward is a true test of leadership.', 'Nitin Nohria', 'management', '2021-03-13 05:01:59'),
(1444, 'Life is 10% what happens to us and 90% how we react to it.', 'Dennis P. Kimbro', 'life', '2021-03-13 05:02:00'),
(1445, 'Last week I was walking by a cemetery, two guys came after me with shovels. It was all about money.', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2021-03-13 05:02:00'),
(1449, 'Once a man has made a commitment to a way of life, he puts the greatest strength in the world behind him. Its something we call heart power. Once a man has made his commitment, nothing will stop him short of success.', 'Vince Lombardi', 'inspire', '2021-03-14 05:02:03'),
(1458, 'That fear you have, that someone out there is going to try and do what we do better, faster, or more uniquely is real. And what is just as real is that we can win by being smarter and moving faster.', 'Kevin Turner', 'management', '2021-03-15 05:02:00'),
(1460, 'I dont have to chase extraordinary moments to find happiness, its right in front of me if Im paying attention and practicing gratitude.', 'Brene Brown', 'life', '2021-03-15 05:02:01'),
(1474, 'Management by objective works - if you know the objectives. Ninety percent of the time you dont.', 'Peter Drucker', 'management', '2021-03-17 05:02:06'),
(1476, 'For all life is a dream, and dreams themselves are only dreams.', 'Pedro Calderon de la Barca', 'life', '2021-03-17 05:02:06'),
(1478, 'Love is the flower youve got to let grow.', 'John Lennon', 'love', '2021-03-17 05:02:07'),
(1481, 'When I was a little kid, I was really scared of the dark. But then I came to understand, dark just means the absence of photons in the visible wavelength 400 to 700 nanometers. Then I thought, well its really silly to be afraid of a lack of photons. Then ', 'Elon Musk', 'inspire', '2021-03-18 05:02:19'),
(1482, 'The very essence of leadership is that you have to have a vision.', 'Theodore Hesburgh', 'management', '2021-03-18 05:02:19'),
(1486, 'Love is only half the illusion the lover, but not his love, is deceived.', 'George Santayana', 'love', '2021-03-18 05:02:20'),
(1489, 'Your overnight success story is always a result of everything you have done in your life until that moment.', 'Bel Pesce', 'inspire', '2021-03-19 05:02:31'),
(1506, 'Test fast, fail fast, adjust fast.', 'Tom Peters', 'management', '2021-03-21 05:02:11'),
(1508, 'Only a life lived for others is a life worthwhile.', 'Albert Einstein', 'life', '2021-03-21 05:02:11'),
(1516, 'Im not naive. I realise that quality of life and income are inextricably bound together, but sooner or later were going to have to ask ourselves whether it is possible to make life more meaningful without charging it to Visa.', 'Daron Hicklin', 'life', '2021-03-22 05:02:15'),
(1518, 'When women love us, they forgive us everything, even our crimes when they do not love us, they give us credit for nothing, not even our virtues.', 'Honore de Balzac', 'love', '2021-03-22 05:02:16'),
(1524, 'Thinking should become your capital asset, no matter whatever ups and downs you come across in your life.', 'Abdul Kalam', 'life', '2021-03-23 05:02:12'),
(1529, 'Dare to BeWhen a new day begins, dare to smile gratefully. When there is darkness, dare to be the first to shine a light. When there is injustice, dare to be the first to condemn it. When something seems difficult, dare to do it anyway. When life seems to', 'Steve Maraboli', 'inspire', '2021-03-24 05:02:10'),
(1533, 'I buy expensive suits. They just look cheap on me.', 'Warren Buffett', 'funny', '2021-03-24 05:02:11'),
(1534, 'Its a shame that the only thing a man can do for eight hours a day is work. He cant eat for eight hours; he cant drink for eight hours; he cant make love for eight hours. The only thing a man can do for eight hours is work.', 'William Faulkner', 'love', '2021-03-24 05:02:11'),
(1535, 'The negative is comparable to the composers score and the print to its performance. Each performance differs in subtle ways.', 'Ansel Adams', 'art', '2021-03-24 05:02:11'),
(1537, 'Sometimes the bravest and most important thing you can do is just show up.', 'Brene Brown', 'inspire', '2021-03-25 05:02:23'),
(1538, 'People work better when they know what the goal is and why. It is important that people look forward to coming to work in the morning and enjoy working.', 'Elon Musk', 'management', '2021-03-25 05:02:23'),
(1542, 'To be capable of steady friendship or lasting love, are the two greatest proofs, not only of goodness of heart, but of strength of mind.', 'William Hazlitt', 'love', '2021-03-25 05:02:24'),
(1553, 'Dont be tempted to break momentum-work through it.', 'Lorii Myers', 'inspire', '2021-03-27 05:02:09'),
(1563, 'In a very real way, ownership is the essence of leadership. When you are ridiculously in charge, then you own whatever happens in a company, school, et cetera.', 'Henry Cloud', 'management', '2021-03-29 04:02:09'),
(1570, 'You will never win if you never begin.', 'Helen Rowland', 'inspire', '2021-03-30 04:01:49'),
(1571, 'Good leadership consists of showing average people how to do the work of superior people.', 'John D. Rockefeller', 'management', '2021-03-30 04:01:50'),
(1581, 'The more we live by our intellect, the less we understand the meaning of life.', 'Leo Tolstoy', 'life', '2021-03-31 04:02:16'),
(1589, 'Just because you can, doesnt mean you should. Or just because its smart, doesnt mean its right.', 'Dale Patridge', 'life', '2021-04-01 04:02:06'),
(1590, 'Common sense and a sense of humor are the same thing, moving at different speeds. A sense of humor is just common sense, dancing.', 'William James', 'funny', '2021-04-01 04:02:06'),
(1591, 'Love means not ever having to say youre sorry.', 'Erich Segal', 'love', '2021-04-01 04:02:07'),
(1594, 'Ignition (n): The motivational process that occurs when your identity becomes linked to a long-term vision of your future. Triggers significant amounts of unconscious energy; usually marked by the realization: That is who I want to be.', ' Daniel Coyle', 'inspire', '2021-04-02 04:01:48'),
(1595, 'If you are building a culture where honest expectations are communicated and peer accountability is the norm, then the group will address poor performance and attitudes.', 'Henry Cloud', 'management', '2021-04-02 04:01:48'),
(1600, 'Rules and models destroy genius and art.', 'William Hazlitt', 'art', '2021-04-02 04:01:49'),
(1607, 'Effort only fully releases its reward after a person refuses to quit.', 'Napoleon Hill', 'inspire', '2021-04-04 04:02:04'),
(1608, 'Leadership is about influencing, developing and mentoring others as well as be influenced, developed and mentored by others.', 'Tom Miglis', 'management', '2021-04-04 04:02:04'),
(1611, 'He found a new way to cover up his bad breath. He holds up his arms.', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2021-04-04 04:02:05'),
(1618, 'Funny how just when you think life cant possibly get any worse it suddenly does.', 'Douglas Noel Adams', 'life', '2021-04-05 04:01:46'),
(1621, 'The artist is a receptacle for the emotions that come from all over the place: from the sky, from the earth, from a scrap of paper, from a passing shape, from a spiders web.', 'Pablo Picasso', 'art', '2021-04-05 04:01:47'),
(1631, 'Let go of who you think youre supposed to be; embrace who you are.', 'Brene Brown', 'inspire', '2021-04-07 04:02:05'),
(1632, 'The only safe ship in a storm is leadership.', 'Faye Wattleton', 'management', '2021-04-07 04:02:05'),
(1634, 'Of chess, it has been said that life is not long enough for it, but that is the fault of life, not chess.', 'William Napier', 'life', '2021-04-07 04:02:06'),
(1648, 'Throw away those books and cassettes on inspirational leadership. Send those consultants packing. Know your job, set a good example for the people under you and put results over politics. Thats all the charisma youll really need to succeed.', 'Dyan Machan', 'management', '2021-04-09 04:02:02'),
(1650, 'Reality is merely an illusion, albeit a very persistent one.', 'Albert Einstein', 'life', '2021-04-09 04:02:02'),
(1651, 'My advice to you is get married: if you find a good wife youll be happy; if not, youll become a philosopher.', 'Socrates', 'funny', '2021-04-09 04:02:02'),
(1658, 'I think midlife crisis is just a point where peoples careers have reached some plateau and they have to reflect on their personal relationships.', 'Bill Murray', 'life', '2021-04-10 04:01:49'),
(1659, 'Once I pulled a job, I was so stupid. I picked a guys pocket on an airplane and made a run for it.', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2021-04-10 04:01:49'),
(1663, 'Stress is like a pulse, if you have it you are alive.', 'Steve Maraboli', 'inspire', '2021-04-11 04:01:59'),
(1666, 'The remedy for lifes broken pieces is not classes, workshops or books. Dont try to heal the broken pieces. Just forgive.', 'Iyanla Vanzant', 'life', '2021-04-11 04:02:00'),
(1667, 'My cousins gay, he went to London only to find out that Big Ben was a clock.', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2021-04-11 04:02:00'),
(1671, 'One does not accumulate but eliminate.\r\nIt is not daily increase but daily\r\ndecrease. The height of cultivation\r\nalways runs to simplicity.', 'Bruce Lee', 'inspire', '2021-04-12 04:01:54'),
(1674, 'The existential vacuum manifests itself mainly in a state of boredom.', 'Viktor Frankl', 'life', '2021-04-12 04:01:55'),
(1675, 'My wife a great driver, she once hit a deer. It was in a zoo. There are a pair of shoes on the dashboard. They belong to the last guy she hit', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2021-04-12 04:01:55'),
(1676, 'A refusal to believe that God loves us is the unbelief which destroys the soul.', 'Edward Norris Kirk', 'love', '2021-04-12 04:01:55'),
(1682, 'Climb the mountains and get their good tidings. Natures peace will flow into you as sunshine flows into trees. The winds will blow their own freshness into you, and the storms their energy, while cares will drop away from you like the leaves of Autumn.', 'John Muir', 'life', '2021-04-13 04:01:52'),
(1687, 'The man who removes a mountain begins by carrying away small stones..', 'Chinese Proverb', 'inspire', '2021-04-14 04:02:15'),
(1688, 'Leaders have to act more quickly today. The pressure comes much faster.', 'Andy Grove', 'management', '2021-04-14 04:02:15'),
(1691, 'Once somebody stole our car. I asked my wife if she saw who it was. She said No, but I did get the license number.', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2021-04-14 04:02:16'),
(1694, 'Take the attitude of a student, never be too big to ask questions, never know too much to learn something new.', 'Og Mandino', 'students', '2021-04-14 04:02:17'),
(1698, 'It is those of us who have been broken that become experts at mending.', 'Steve Maraboli', 'life', '2021-04-15 04:03:25'),
(1699, 'I once asked a policeman how far it was to the subway. He said, I dont know, no one has ever made it.', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2021-04-15 04:03:26'),
(1700, 'Stand by your man. Give him two arms to cling to and something warm to come to.', 'Tammy Wynette', 'love', '2021-04-15 04:03:26'),
(1703, 'Every day you have a choice to be honest or deceptive. If you commit to telling the truth, you will win. Youll win more trust, youll win more business, and youll win more peace of mind. Youll break the system and be even more successful.', 'Dale Patridge', 'inspire', '2021-04-16 04:02:10');
INSERT INTO `quote_of_the_day` (`quote_of_the_day_id`, `quote`, `author`, `category`, `time`) VALUES
(1704, 'Start with the end in mind.', 'Stephen R. Covey', 'management', '2021-04-16 04:02:11'),
(1707, 'Persistence is very important. You should not give up unless you are forced to give up.', 'Elon Musk', 'inspire', '2021-04-17 04:01:56'),
(1712, 'There is no criterion in life that will carry a marriage, or satisfy the marriage, except your creative communication with the man you love.', 'Yogi Bhajan', 'love', '2021-04-17 04:01:57'),
(1713, 'Art = a mad search for individualism.', 'Paul Gauguin', 'art', '2021-04-17 04:01:57'),
(1715, 'Perfection is not attainable, but if we chase perfection we can catch excellence..', 'Vince Lombardi', 'inspire', '2021-04-18 04:02:23'),
(1719, 'She looked at my calendar and wanted to know who JUNE was.', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2021-04-18 04:02:24'),
(1723, 'Once your excuses are gone, you will simply have to settle for being awesome!', 'Lorii Myers', 'inspire', '2021-04-19 04:02:06'),
(1726, 'While theres life, theres hope.', 'Marcus Tullius Cicero', 'life', '2021-04-19 04:02:07'),
(1731, 'An aspirational diet will have you dreaming of success; but its the attachment of expectations and tangible goals that feeds the desire, persistence, and fortitude required to make the win.', 'Lorii Myers', 'inspire', '2021-04-20 04:02:23'),
(1732, 'Fail to honor people, they fail to honor you; but of a good leader, who talks little, when his work is done, his aims fulfilled, they will all say, We did this ourselves.', 'Lao Tzu', 'management', '2021-04-20 04:02:24'),
(1734, 'And this, our life, exempt from public haunt, finds tongues in trees, books in the running brooks, sermons in stones, and good in everything.', 'William Shakespeare', 'life', '2021-04-20 04:02:24'),
(1735, 'I saw a bank that said 24 Hour Banking, but I dont have that much time.', 'Steven Wright', 'funny', '2021-04-20 04:02:24'),
(1739, 'If youre walking down the right path and youre willing to keep walking, eventually youll make progress.', 'Barack Obama', 'inspire', '2021-04-21 04:02:08'),
