(2083, 'Winning is nice if you dont lose your integrity in the process.', 'Arnold Horshak', 'inspire', '2021-06-05 04:02:27'),
(2086, 'While you are proclaiming peace with your lips, be careful to have it even more fully in your heart.', 'St. Francis of Assisi', 'life', '2021-06-05 04:02:34'),
(2087, 'My cousins gay, in school while other kids were dissecting frog, he was opening flies.', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2021-06-05 04:02:36'),
(2089, 'Music is Gods gift to man, the only art of Heaven given to earth, the only art of earth we take to Heaven.', 'Walter Savage Landor', 'art', '2021-06-05 04:02:41'),
(2092, 'Reason and calm judgment: the qualities especially belonging to a leader.', 'Publius Cornelius Tacitus', 'management', '2021-06-06 04:02:18'),
(2093, 'The only way to prove that youre a good sport is to lose.', 'Ernie Banks', 'sports', '2021-06-06 04:02:20'),
(2095, 'Relax? How can anybody relax and play golf? You have to grip the club, dont you?', 'Ben Hogan', 'funny', '2021-06-06 04:02:24'),
(2096, 'Byron says that it is easier to die for the woman one loves that to live with her.', 'Andre Maurois', 'love', '2021-06-06 04:02:27'),
(2097, 'The history of modern art is also the history of the progressive loss of arts audience. Art has increasingly become the concern of the artist and the bafflement of the public.', 'Paul Gauguin', 'art', '2021-06-06 04:02:29'),
(2100, 'As we look ahead into the next century, leaders will be those who empower others.', 'Bill Gates', 'management', '2021-06-07 04:02:17'),
(2103, 'Never go to a doctor whose office plants have died.', 'Erma Bombeck', 'funny', '2021-06-07 04:02:24'),
(2104, 'We love because its the only true adventure.', 'Nikki Giovanni', 'love', '2021-06-07 04:02:26'),
(2107, 'Sometimes you climb out of bed in the morning and you think, Im not going to make it, but you laugh inside - remembering all the times youve felt that way.', 'Charles Bukowski', 'inspire', '2021-06-08 04:02:09'),
(2108, 'A reliable way to make people believe in falsehoods is frequent repetition, because familiarity is not easily distinguished from truth. Authoritarian institutions and marketers have always known this fact.', 'Daniel Kahneman', 'management', '2021-06-08 04:02:11'),
(2110, 'The human mind and body are truly extraordinary. They are the quintessence of excellence in motion. We talk, touch, see, hear, taste, smell, and feel. We dream, aspire, and become. All that we are is mind and body and spirit-that is our universe.', 'Lorii Myers', 'life', '2021-06-08 04:02:15'),
(2111, 'Im not concerned about all hell breaking loose, but that a PART of hell will break loose.. Itll be much harder to detect.', 'George Carlin', 'funny', '2021-06-08 04:02:17'),
(2118, 'Life has meaning only if one barters it day by day for something other than itself.', 'Antoine de SaintExupery', 'life', '2021-06-09 04:01:55'),
(2119, 'One night she told me to put out the garbage. I told her you cooked it, you take it out.', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2021-06-09 04:01:58'),
(2120, 'Love and dignity cannot share the same abode.', 'Ovid', 'love', '2021-06-09 04:02:00'),
(2124, 'Remember, confrontation is about reconciliation and awareness, not judgement or anger.', 'Dale Patridge', 'management', '2021-06-10 04:02:19'),
(2126, 'The quality of a persons life is in direct proportion to their commitment to excellence, regardless of their chosen field of endeavor.', 'Vince Lombardi', 'life', '2021-06-10 04:02:24'),
(2127, 'Dont forget Mothers Day. Or as they call it in Beverly Hills, Dads Third Wife Day.', 'Jay Leno', 'funny', '2021-06-10 04:02:26'),
(2128, 'I know of only one duty, and that is to love.', 'Albert Camus', 'love', '2021-06-10 04:02:28'),
(2130, 'It is important that students bring a certain rafamuffin, barefoot, irreverence to their studies; they are not here to worship what is known, but to question it', 'Jacob Chanowski', 'students', '2021-06-10 04:02:33'),
(2132, 'The growth and development of people is the highest calling of leadership.', 'Harvey S. Firestone', 'management', '2021-06-11 04:02:05'),
(2133, 'If you work hard and you play well, all of those critics will quiet themselves pretty quickly.', 'Peyton Manning', 'sports', '2021-06-11 04:02:08'),
(2134, 'It is inevitable that some defeat will enter even the most victorious life. The human spirit is never finished when it is defeated.. It is finished when it surrenders.', 'Ben Stein', 'life', '2021-06-11 04:02:10'),
(2136, 'I think that God will provide opportunities and people and experiences, and everything we need to date and ultimately to find the one.', 'Henry Cloud', 'love', '2021-06-11 04:02:14'),
(2141, 'Serious sport has nothing to do with fair play. It is bound up with hatred, jealousy, boastfulness, disregard of all rules and sadistic pleasure in witnessing violence. In other words, it is war minus the shooting.', 'George Orwell', 'sports', '2021-06-12 04:02:18'),
(2144, 'Love is a promise, love is a souvenir, once given never forgotten, never let it disappear.', 'John Lennon', 'love', '2021-06-12 04:02:24'),
(2150, 'Go after what it is that creates meaning in your life and then trust yourself to handle the stress that follows.', 'Kelly McGonigal', 'life', '2021-06-13 04:02:10'),
(2151, 'My wife has to be the worst cook. In my house, we pray after we eat.', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2021-06-13 04:02:13'),
(2152, 'Love is space and time measured by the heart.', 'Marcel Proust', 'love', '2021-06-13 04:02:15'),
(2155, 'Do the best you can until you know better. Then when you know better, do better.', 'Maya Angelou', 'inspire', '2021-06-14 04:02:24'),
(2156, 'In most cases being a good boss means hiring talented people and then getting out of their way.', 'Tina Fey', 'management', '2021-06-14 04:02:26'),
(2158, 'Its the simple things in life that are the most extraordinary; only wise men are able to understand them.', 'Paulo Coelho', 'life', '2021-06-14 04:02:31'),
(2159, 'Im at the age where I want two girls. In case I fall asleep they will have someone to talk to.', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2021-06-14 04:02:33'),
(2161, 'Progressive art can assist people to learn not only about the objective forces at work in the society in which they live, but also about the intensely social character of their interior lives. Ultimately, it can propel people toward social emancipation.', 'Salvador Dalí', 'art', '2021-06-14 04:02:37'),
(2162, 'I tell my students, When you get these jobs that you have been so brilliantly trained for, just remember that your real job is that if you are free, you need to free somebody else. If you have some power, then your job is to empower somebody else. This is', 'Toni Morrison', 'students', '2021-06-14 04:02:40'),
(2163, 'He who is not courageous enough to take risks will accomplish nothing in life.', 'Mohamad Ali', 'inspire', '2021-06-15 04:02:11'),
(2166, 'There is a trade off - as you grow older you gain wisdom but you lose spontaneity.', 'Kenny Rogers', 'life', '2021-06-15 04:02:18'),
(2167, 'My mother used to say that there are no strangers, only friends you havent met yet. Shes now in a maximum security twilight home in Australia.', 'Dame Edna Everage', 'funny', '2021-06-15 04:02:21'),
(2168, 'Talk to yourself like you would to someone you love.', 'Brene Brown', 'love', '2021-06-15 04:02:24'),
(2169, 'When I am finishing a picture, I hold some Godmade object up to it a rock, a flower, the branch of a tree or my hand as a final test. If the painting stands up beside a thing man cannot make, the painting is authentic. If theres a clash between the two, i', 'Marc Chagall', 'art', '2021-06-15 04:02:26'),
(2170, 'Teachers knew every one of the students, their secrets, their grades, their home situations. And all the students knew the teachers. It was like teachers were people who finally were the most popular at school.', 'Victoria Kahler', 'students', '2021-06-15 04:02:28'),
(2172, 'Leaders are Readers', 'Charles Jones', 'management', '2021-06-16 04:02:25'),
(2176, 'Love is an attempt to change a piece of a dream world into reality.', 'Theodor Reik', 'love', '2021-06-16 04:02:33'),
(2179, 'From now on we live in a world where man has walked on the Moon. Its not a miracle; we just decided to go.', 'Tom Hanks', 'inspire', '2021-06-17 04:02:08'),
(2180, 'Most of what we call management consists of making it difficult for people to get their work done.', 'Peter F. Drucker', 'management', '2021-06-17 04:02:10'),
(2181, 'I know I am getting better at golf because I am hitting fewer spectators.', 'Gerald R. Ford', 'sports', '2021-06-17 04:02:13'),
(2182, 'Never waste your time trying to explain who you are to people who are committed to misunderstanding you.', 'Dream Hampton', 'life', '2021-06-17 04:02:15'),
(2183, 'A computer once beat me at chess, but it was no match for me at kick boxing.', 'Emo Philips', 'funny', '2021-06-17 04:02:17'),
(2184, 'Love is or it aint. Thin love aint love at all.', 'Toni Morrison', 'love', '2021-06-17 04:02:19'),
(2185, 'Art, like morality, consists in drawing the line somewhere.', 'Gilbert K. Chesterton', 'art', '2021-06-17 04:02:21'),
(2186, 'No student knows his subject: the most he knows is where and how to find out the things he does not know', 'Woodrow T. Wilson', 'students', '2021-06-17 04:02:24'),
(2187, 'If we are not stretching, we are not growing. If we are not growing, we are probably not fulfilling our potential. The only person in this room that knows your potential is you.', 'Kevin Turner ', 'inspire', '2021-06-18 04:01:50'),
(2189, 'Football is a team sport, and there is no one individual who is bigger than the next person.', 'Emmitt Smith', 'sports', '2021-06-18 04:01:54'),
(2190, 'Somewhere between the bottom of the climb and the summit is the answer to the mystery why we climb.', 'Greg Child', 'life', '2021-06-18 04:01:57'),
(2191, 'The embarrassing thing is that the salad dressing is outgrossing my films.', 'Paul Newman', 'funny', '2021-06-18 04:01:59'),
(2192, 'To fall in love is easy, even to remain in it is not difficult; our human loneliness is cause enough. But it is a hard quest worth making to find a comrade through whose steady presence one becomes steadily the person one desires to be.', 'Elijah Wood', 'love', '2021-06-18 04:02:01'),
(2196, 'Formula for success: under promise and over deliver', 'Tom Peters', 'management', '2021-06-19 04:02:16'),
(2198, 'Who will tell whether one happy moment of love or the joy of breathing or walking on a bright morning and smelling the fresh air, is not worth all the suffering and effort which life implies.', 'Erich Fromm', 'life', '2021-06-19 04:02:20'),
(2199, 'Movie acting suits me because I only need to be good for ninety seconds at a time.', 'Bill Murray', 'funny', '2021-06-19 04:02:23'),
(2200, 'The physicality of a real relationship - one that encompasses mind, body and soul - ultimately makes it more fulfilling and powerful than any virtual relationship ever could be.', 'Henry Cloud', 'love', '2021-06-19 04:02:25'),
(2201, 'Dance is the only art of which we ourselves are the stuff of which it is made.', 'Ted Shawn', 'art', '2021-06-19 04:02:27'),
(2203, 'If youre changing the world, youre working on important things. Youre excited to get up in the morning.', 'Larry Page', 'inspire', '2021-06-20 04:02:00'),
(2204, 'Men make history, and not the other way around. In periods where there is no leadership, society stands still. Progress occurs when courageous, skillful leaders seize the opportunity to change things for the better.', 'Harry S Truman', 'management', '2021-06-20 04:02:03'),
(2206, 'Things are not bad in themselves, but our cowardice makes them so.', 'Michel de Montaigne', 'life', '2021-06-20 04:02:07'),
(2207, 'I rant, therefore I am.', 'Dennis Miller', 'funny', '2021-06-20 04:02:09'),
(2208, 'Love is metaphysical gravity.', 'R. Buckminster Fuller', 'love', '2021-06-20 04:02:11'),
(2209, 'Modern art is what happens when painters stop looking at girls and persuade themselves that they have a better idea.', 'John Ciardi', 'art', '2021-06-20 04:02:14'),
(2212, 'A leader is a dealer in hope.', 'Napoleon Bonaparte', 'management', '2021-06-21 04:02:07'),
(2213, 'Fishing.. Is a sport invented by insects and you are the bait.', 'P. J. ORourke', 'sports', '2021-06-21 04:02:09'),
(2214, 'One day it just clicks.. You realize whats important and what isnt. You learn to care less about what other people think of you and more about what you think of yourself. You realize how far youve come and you remember when you thought things were such a ', 'Steve Maraboli', 'life', '2021-06-21 04:02:11'),
(2216, 'Can miles truly separate you from friends.. If you want to be with someone you love, arent you already there?', 'Richard Bach', 'love', '2021-06-21 04:02:16'),
(2220, 'Leadership has a harder job to do than just choose sides. It must bring sides together.', 'Jesse Jackson', 'management', '2021-06-22 04:02:06'),
(2222, 'Whatever you value, be committed to it and let nothing distract you from this goal. The uncommitted life, like Platos unexamined life, is not worth living.', 'Theodore Hesburgh', 'life', '2021-06-22 04:02:10'),
(2223, 'My wife had her drivers test the other day. She got 8 out of 10. The other 2 guys jumped clear.', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2021-06-22 04:02:12'),
(2224, 'Love is a smoke made with the fume of sighs.', 'William Shakespeare', 'love', '2021-06-22 04:02:14'),
(2227, 'You must be the change you want to see in the world..', 'M.K. Gandhi', 'inspire', '2021-06-23 04:02:06'),
(2228, 'Most men, after a little freedom, have preferred authority with the consoling assurances and the economy of effort it brings.', 'Walter Lippmann', 'management', '2021-06-23 04:02:08'),
(2230, 'If you want to become healthy, you have to surround yourself with a group of people that are getting healthy, and you have to be connected to a community that is doing what you want to do.', 'Henry Cloud', 'life', '2021-06-23 04:02:13'),
(2232, 'Life will always get busy, make time to do the things you love.', 'Lailah Gifty Akita', 'love', '2021-06-23 04:02:17'),
(2235, 'Your success will not be determined by your gender or your ethnicity, but only on the scope of your dreams and your hard work to achieve them.', 'Zaha Hadid', 'inspire', '2021-06-24 04:02:06'),
(2238, 'Those who hope for no other life are dead even for this', 'Johann Wolfgang von Goethe', 'life', '2021-06-24 04:02:13'),
(2240, 'In our life there is a single color, as on an artists palette, which provides the meaning of life and art. It is the color of love.', 'Marc Chagall', 'love', '2021-06-24 04:02:17'),
(2241, 'The most beautiful thing we can experience is the mysterious. It is the source of all true art and all science. He to whom this emotion is a stranger, who can no longer pause to wonder and stand rapt in awe, is as good as dead: his eyes are closed.', 'Albert Einstein', 'art', '2021-06-24 04:02:20'),
(2246, 'If I had to live my life again, Id make the same mistakes, only sooner.', 'Tallulah Bankhead', 'life', '2021-06-25 04:02:10'),
(2247, 'I dont have a bank account because I dont know my mothers maiden name.', 'Paula Poundstone', 'funny', '2021-06-25 04:02:12'),
(2248, 'It is difficult to know at what moment love begins; it is less difficult to know that it has begun.', 'Henry Wadsworth Longfellow', 'love', '2021-06-25 04:02:14'),
(2249, 'Creating the kind of connections between people that lead to collective civic action, political expression, community dialogue, shared cultural experiences.', 'Giovanni Morassutti', 'art', '2021-06-25 04:02:16'),
(2252, 'Good leaders make people feel that theyre at the very heart of things, not at the periphery.', 'Warren G. Bennis', 'management', '2021-06-26 04:02:03'),
(2254, 'Shame is the most powerful, master emotion. Its the fear that were not good enough.', 'Brene Brown', 'life', '2021-06-26 04:02:07'),
(2255, 'Arguments out of a pretty mouth are unanswerable.', 'Joseph Addison', 'funny', '2021-06-26 04:02:09'),
(2256, 'Love is loves reward.', 'John Dryden', 'love', '2021-06-26 04:02:12'),
(2257, 'Acting is a matter of giving away secrets.', 'Ellen Barkin', 'art', '2021-06-26 04:02:14'),
(2260, 'Leadership is practiced not so much in words as in attitude and in actions.', 'Harold S. Geneen', 'management', '2021-06-27 04:02:05'),
(2262, 'Wisdom is the reward you get for a lifetime of listening when youd have preferred to talk.', 'Doug Larson', 'life', '2021-06-27 04:02:10'),
(2263, 'Bigamy is having one wife too many. Monogamy is the same.', 'Oscar Wilde', 'funny', '2021-06-27 04:02:12'),
(2267, 'Great things are done by a series of small things brought together.', 'Vincent Van Gogh', 'inspire', '2021-06-28 04:02:05'),
(2268, '.. Not doing what we love in the name of greed is very poor management of our lives.', 'Warren Buffett', 'management', '2021-06-28 04:02:07'),
(2269, 'Although golf was originally restricted to wealthy, overweight Protestants, today its open to anybody who owns hideous clothing.', 'Dave Barry', 'sports', '2021-06-28 04:02:09'),
(2270, 'Endings are a part of life, and we are actually wired to execute them. But because of trauma, developmental failures, and other reasons, we shy away from the steps that could open up whole new worlds of development and growth.', 'Henry Cloud', 'life', '2021-06-28 04:02:12'),
(2271, 'Two things are infinite: the universe and human stupidity; and Im not sure about the the universe.', 'Albert Einstein', 'funny', '2021-06-28 04:02:14'),
(2272, 'The dove loves when it quarrels; the wolf hates when it flatters.', 'Saint Augustine', 'love', '2021-06-28 04:02:16'),
(2273, 'To draw, you must close your eyes and sing.', 'Pablo Picasso', 'art', '2021-06-28 04:02:18'),
(2274, 'By the time these students enter the workforce, many of the jobs they will apply for ill be in industries that dont even exist yet. Thats a hard future to prepare someone for. Teachers have their sights set on the real goal: not to produce Ivy League grad', 'Taylor Mali', 'students', '2021-06-28 04:02:21'),
(2275, 'You should never view your challenges as a disadvantage. Instead, its important for you to understand that your experience facing and overcoming adversity is actually one of your biggest advantages.', 'Michelle Obama', 'inspire', '2021-06-29 04:02:08'),
(2276, 'Cause change and lead; accept change and survive; resist change and die.', 'Ray Norda', 'management', '2021-06-29 04:02:10'),
(2277, 'Ive never left the field saying, I could have done more to get ready. And that gives me peace of mind.', 'Peyton Manning', 'sports', '2021-06-29 04:02:13'),
(2278, 'Life is something to do when you cant get to sleep.', 'Fran Lebowitz', 'life', '2021-06-29 04:02:15'),
(2279, 'Im writing an unauthorized autobiography.', 'Steven Wright', 'funny', '2021-06-29 04:02:17'),
(2280, 'Stop complaining. Start creating.', 'Dale Patridge', 'inspire', '2021-06-30 04:02:30'),
(2281, 'Effective leadership is putting first things first. Effective management is discipline carrying it out.', 'Stephen Covey', 'management', '2021-06-30 04:02:32'),
(2282, 'Im opposed to any sport that reduces the coefficient of friction between me and the ground.', 'Alan Kotok', 'sports', '2021-06-30 04:02:35'),
(2283, 'I actually think happiness is the absence of suffering. It comes from peace. That comes from being careful about desire, judgment, and reaction.', 'Naval Ravikant', 'life', '2021-06-30 04:02:37'),
(2284, 'Do you know the difference between education and experience? Education is when you read the fine print; experience is what you get when you dont.', 'Pete Seeger', 'funny', '2021-06-30 04:02:40'),
(2285, 'Love is the most difficult and dangerous form of courage. Courage is the most desperate, admirable and noble kind of love.', 'Delmore Schwartz', 'love', '2021-06-30 04:02:42'),
(2286, 'Lying in bed would be an altogether perfect and supreme experience if only one had a colored pencil long enough to draw on the ceiling.', 'Gilbert K. Chesterton', 'art', '2021-06-30 04:02:45'),
(2287, 'Once in a while our school has half days, and the teachers spend the afternoon in service, which I think must be a group therapy for having to deal with us.', 'Neal Shusterman', 'students', '2021-06-30 04:02:47'),
(2288, 'Vision without action is daydream. Action without vision is nightmare..', 'Japanese Proverb', 'inspire', '2021-07-01 04:02:07'),
(2291, 'This is not a dress rehearsal; this is your life.', 'Bill Murray', 'life', '2021-07-01 04:02:14'),
(2292, 'I was married by a judge. I should have asked for a jury.', 'Groucho Marx', 'funny', '2021-07-01 04:02:16'),
(2293, 'And he who loves last loves loudest.', 'Edmund Cooper', 'love', '2021-07-01 04:02:18'),
(2294, 'Film contains potentialities for the combination of all the arts such as Wagner never dreamt of.', 'Ralph Vaughan Williams', 'art', '2021-07-01 04:02:21'),
(2296, 'I keep asking myself these three questions.. What do you have? What do you want? What will you give up?', 'Jack Ma', 'inspire', '2021-07-02 04:02:16'),
(2297, 'Leadership is the art of getting someone else to do something you want done because he wants to do it.', 'Dwight D Eisenhower', 'management', '2021-07-02 04:02:18'),
(2298, 'I play golf with friends sometimes, but there are never friendly games.', 'Ben Hogan', 'sports', '2021-07-02 04:02:20'),
(2299, 'The show is Fix My Life! Get it? Life. I do not fix people.', 'Iyanla Vanzant', 'life', '2021-07-02 04:02:23'),
(2301, 'Great thoughts speak only to the thoughtful mind, but great actions speak to all mankind.', 'Theodore Roosevelt', 'management', '2021-07-03 04:02:16'),
(2303, 'Uncertainty and mystery are energies of life. Dont let them scare you unduly, for they keep boredom at bay and spark creativity.', 'R. I. Fitzhenry', 'life', '2021-07-03 04:02:21');
INSERT INTO `quote_of_the_day` (`quote_of_the_day_id`, `quote`, `author`, `category`, `time`) VALUES
(2305, 'Not where I breathe, but where I love, I live Not where I love, but where I am, I die.', 'Robert Southey', 'love', '2021-07-03 04:02:25'),
(2306, 'Art reaches its greatest peak when devoid of self-consciousness. Freedom discovers man the moment he loses concern over what impression he is making or about to make.', 'Bruce Lee', 'art', '2021-07-03 04:02:27'),
(2307, 'We, Equality 7-2521, were not happy in those year in the Home of the Students. It was not that the learning was too hard for us. It was that the learning was too easy. This is a great sin, to be born with a head which is too quick. It is not good to be di', 'Ayn Rand', 'students', '2021-07-03 04:02:30'),
(2308, 'Logic will get you from A to B. Imagination will take you everywhere.', 'Albert Einstein', 'inspire', '2021-07-04 04:02:15'),
(2309, 'Think in terms of opportunities and solutions instead of problems, disappointment, and failure.', 'Lorii Myers', 'management', '2021-07-04 04:02:18'),
(2311, 'Life is a progress, and not a station.', 'Ralph Waldo Emerson', 'life', '2021-07-04 04:02:22'),
(2312, 'He is (Sonny Liston) too ugly to be the world champ. The world champ should be pretty like me!', 'Mohamad Ali', 'funny', '2021-07-04 04:02:24'),
(2313, 'If love is the answer, could you please rephrase the question?', 'Lily Tomlin', 'love', '2021-07-04 04:02:27'),
(2314, 'I believe that nowadays we are in the process of establishing a new relationship between humanity, creativity and nature.', 'Giovanni Morassutti', 'art', '2021-07-04 04:02:29'),
(2316, 'Not every day is going to offer us a chance to save somebodys life, but every day offers us an opportunity to affect one.', 'Mark Bezos', 'inspire', '2021-07-05 04:02:05'),
(2317, 'As a leader.. I have always endeavored to listen to what each and every person in a discussion had to say before venturing my own opinion. Oftentimes, my own opinion will simply represent a con-sensus of what I heard in the discussion. I always remember t', 'Nelson Mandela', 'management', '2021-07-05 04:02:07'),
(2319, 'I wasnt ready for fame and all that brings to your life. It was an amazing experience, but so overwhelming, because no one can tell you beforehand when it will happen or how it will impact you. So no one can tell you how to handle it, being stopped everyw', 'Iyanla Vanzant', 'life', '2021-07-05 04:02:11'),
(2320, 'Mr. Klamp laid down the law. No tardiness, no talking above 40 decibels, no untied shoelaces, no visible undergarments, no eating, no chewing gum, no chewing tobacco, no chewing betel nuts, no chewing coca leaves, no chewing out students (unless Mr. Klamp', 'Polly Shulman', 'funny', '2021-07-05 04:02:14'),
(2321, 'In my mind, marriage is a spiritual partnership and union in which we willingly give and receive love, create and share intimacy, and open ourselves to be available and accessible to another human being in order to heal, learn and grow.', 'Iyanla Vanzant', 'love', '2021-07-05 04:02:16'),
(2322, 'Inside you theres an artist you dont know about. Hes not interested in how things look different in moonlight.', 'Auguste Rodin', 'art', '2021-07-05 04:02:18'),
(2323, 'I have never encountered any children in any group who are not geniuses. There is no mystery on how to teach them. The first thing you do is treat them like human beings and the second thing you do is love them.', 'Asa Hilliard', 'students', '2021-07-05 04:02:20'),
(2325, 'The leader can never close the gap between himself and the group. If he does, he is no longer what he must be. He must walk a tightrope between the consent he must win and the control he must exert.', 'Vince Lombardi', 'management', '2021-07-06 04:02:04'),
(2326, 'I think it is important for all those young out there, who someday hope to play real football, where you throw it and kick it and run with it and put it in your hands, a distinction should be made that football is democratic, capitalism, whereas soccer is', 'Jack Kemp', 'sports', '2021-07-06 04:02:07'),
(2327, 'We know how we were born, but know not how we will die.', 'Giovanni Morassutti', 'life', '2021-07-06 04:02:09'),
(2329, 'I would rather live and love where death is king than have eternal life where love is not.', 'Robert Green Ingersoll', 'love', '2021-07-06 04:02:13'),
(2330, 'Wine making is an artistic creation in which you deal with a variety of styles, colors, and inspiration therefore good wine, like good art, can evoke emotions, sensations and create an experience which leaves a lasting impression.', 'Giovanni Morassutti', 'art', '2021-07-06 04:02:16'),
(2331, 'Students now arrive at the university ignorant and cynical about our political heritage, lacking the wherewithal to be either inspired by it or seriously critical of it', 'Allan Bloom', 'students', '2021-07-06 04:02:18'),
(2333, 'It is a fine thing to have ability, but the ability to discover ability in others is the true test.', 'Lou Holtz', 'management', '2021-07-07 04:02:08'),
(2334, 'I really appreciate the sport background because the structure and the discipline that that gives a person is incredible, and it just carries with you wherever you go.', 'Estella Warren', 'sports', '2021-07-07 04:02:10'),
(2335, 'Love is the immortal flow of energy that nourishes, extends and preserves. Its eternal goal is life.', 'Smiley Blanton', 'life', '2021-07-07 04:02:12'),
(2336, 'A fools brain digests philosophy into folly, science into superstition, and art into pedantry. Hence University education.', 'George Bernard Shaw', 'funny', '2021-07-07 04:02:14'),
(2337, 'If you are a card-carrying human being, chances are that you share the same fear as all other humans: the fear of losing love, respect and connection to others. And if you are human, in order to avoid or prevent the pain, trauma and perceived devastation ', 'Iyanla Vanzant', 'love', '2021-07-07 04:02:17'),
(2338, 'Words are often seen hunting for an idea, but ideas are never seen hunting for words.', 'Josh Billings', 'art', '2021-07-07 04:02:19'),
(2339, 'When I was a graduate student at Harvard, I learned about showers and central heating. Ten years later, I learned about breakfast meetings. These are Americas three great contributions to civilization.', 'Mervyn A. King', 'students', '2021-07-07 04:02:21'),
(2340, 'Your fears, your critics, your heroes, your villains: They are fictions you perceive as reality. Choose to see through them. Choose to let them go.', 'Isaac Lidsky', 'inspire', '2021-07-08 04:02:00'),
(2341, 'A leader is someone who steps back from the entire system and tries to build a more collaborative, more innovative system that will work over the long term.', 'Robert Reich', 'management', '2021-07-08 04:02:02'),
(2342, 'Hockey is the original extreme sport.', 'Tom Ward', 'sports', '2021-07-08 04:02:05'),
(2343, 'Everyday new difficulties arise, new compromises has to be made, new chaos to be dealt with. \r\n\r\nNo story in this world could end happily! If it ended happily it would be your death. So enjoy everyday as if its your last day!', 'Always Madhu', 'life', '2021-07-08 04:02:07'),
(2344, 'If you think youre leading and no one is following you, then youre only taking a walk.', 'Afghan Proverb', 'funny', '2021-07-08 04:02:09'),
(2345, 'We are shaped and fashioned by what we love.', 'Johann Wolfgang von Goethe', 'love', '2021-07-08 04:02:11'),
(2346, 'Painting is easy when you dont know how, but very difficult when you do.', 'Edgar Degas', 'art', '2021-07-08 04:02:13'),
(2347, 'An exceedingly confident student would in theory make a terrible student. Why would he take school seriously when he feels that he can outwit his teachers?', 'Criss Jami', 'students', '2021-07-08 04:02:16'),
(2348, 'One voice can change a room, and if one voice can change a room, then it can change a city, and if it can change a city, it can change a state, and if it change a state, it can change a nation, and if it can change a nation, it can change the world. Your ', 'Barack Obama', 'inspire', '2021-07-09 04:02:00'),
(2349, 'In preparing for battle I have always found that plans are useless, but planning is indispensable.', 'Dwight Eisenhower', 'management', '2021-07-09 04:02:02'),
(2350, 'You win some, lose some, and wreck some.', 'Dale Earnhardt', 'sports', '2021-07-09 04:02:05'),
(2351, 'There are days you are going to feel sad. That is nothing you can choose. But you can make stuff. Make films. Draw. Write. Itll make a world of difference.', 'Pete Doctor', 'life', '2021-07-09 04:02:07'),
(2352, 'Boy were we poor, if I wasnt born a boy I would of had nothing to play with.', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2021-07-09 04:02:09'),
(2353, 'The way to love anything is to realize that it may be lost.', 'Gilbert K. Chesterton', 'love', '2021-07-09 04:02:11'),
(2354, 'Any work of art that makes us feel the artist tried too hard lacks clarity.', 'Clayton Whitehill', 'art', '2021-07-09 04:02:14'),
(2355, 'Todays students can put dope in their veins or hope in their brains. If they can conceive it and believe it, they can achieve it. They must know it is not their aptitude but their attitude that will determine their altitude.', 'Jesse Jackson', 'students', '2021-07-09 04:02:16'),
(2356, 'Our words are buttressed by our deeds, and our deeds are inspired by our convictions.', 'Theodore Hesburgh', 'inspire', '2021-07-10 04:02:07'),
(2357, 'Those who try to lead the people can only do so by following the mob', 'Oscar Wilde', 'management', '2021-07-10 04:02:10'),
(2358, 'Football isnt a contact sport, its a collision sport. Dancing is a contact sport.', 'Duffy Daugherty', 'sports', '2021-07-10 04:02:12'),
(2359, 'There are some who complain most energetically and inconsolably of any, because they are, as they say, doing their duty. I also have in my mind that seemingly wealthy, but most terribly impoverished class of all, who have accumulated dross, but know not h', 'Henry David Thoreau', 'life', '2021-07-10 04:02:14'),
(2361, 'Be glad of life because it gives you the chance to love, to work, to play, and to look up at the stars.', 'Henry Van Dyke', 'love', '2021-07-10 04:02:18'),
(2362, 'We, by our arts may be called the grandsons of God.', 'Leonardo da Vinci', 'art', '2021-07-10 04:02:21'),
(2363, 'A student never forgets an encouraging private word, when it is given with sincere respect and admiration.', 'William Lyon Phelps', 'students', '2021-07-10 04:02:23'),
(2364, 'Theres such a thin line between winning and losing.', 'John R. Tunis', 'inspire', '2021-07-11 04:02:01'),
(2365, 'I am now going to make you a gift that will stay with you the rest of your life. For the rest of your life, every time you say Weve always done it that way, my ghost will appear and haunt you for twentyfour hours.', 'Grace Murray Hopper', 'management', '2021-07-11 04:02:04'),
(2366, 'Ill be floating like a butterfly and stinging like a bee.', 'Muhammad Ali', 'sports', '2021-07-11 04:02:06'),
(2367, 'Every sentence I utter must be understood not as an affirmation, but as a question.', 'Niels Bohr', 'life', '2021-07-11 04:02:08'),
(2368, 'Youre only as good as your last haircut.', 'Fran Lebowitz', 'funny', '2021-07-11 04:02:10'),
(2369, 'You cant trust a promise someone makes while theyre drunk, in love, hungry, or running for office.', 'Joe Moore', 'love', '2021-07-11 04:02:13'),
(2370, 'The essence of all art is to have pleasure in giving pleasure.', 'Dale Carnegie', 'art', '2021-07-11 04:02:15'),
(2371, 'Today is not just another ordinary day. It is an opportunity to do, or say, something that just might inspire someone to greater becoming.. Especially a wayward youth.', 'T.F. Hodge', 'students', '2021-07-11 04:02:17'),
(2374, 'Growing up as an athlete, I started skating very young. My parents didnt know anything about the sport, so they went with the flow. I had two great coaches who gave great advice and gave guidelines for my parents. My parents let the coaches dictate what w', 'Kristi Yamaguchi', 'sports', '2021-07-12 04:02:02'),
(2376, 'If they can make penicillin out of moldy bread, they can sure make something out of you.', 'Mohamad Ali', 'funny', '2021-07-12 04:02:07'),
(2377, 'Motherhood: All love begins and ends there.', 'Robert Browning', 'love', '2021-07-12 04:02:09'),
(2378, 'The artist who aims at perfection in everything achieves it in nothing.', 'Eugene Delacroix', 'art', '2021-07-12 04:02:11'),
(2379, 'I also believe that academic freedom should protect the right of a professor or student to advocate Marxism, socialism, communism, or any other minority viewpoint-no matter how distasteful to the majority, provided..', 'Richard M. Nixon', 'students', '2021-07-12 04:02:13'),
(2380, 'What is the one sentence summary of how you change the world? Always work hard on something uncomfortably exciting!', 'Larry Page', 'inspire', '2021-07-13 04:02:11'),
