(2407, 'Everything has seasons, and we have to be able to recognize when somethings time has passed and be able to move into the next season. Everything that is alive requires pruning as well, which is a great metaphor for endings.', 'Henry Cloud', 'life', '2021-07-16 04:02:13'),
(2408, 'You see, wire telegraph is a kind of a very, very long cat. You pull his tail in New York and his head is meowing in Los Angeles. Do you understand this? And radio operates exactly the same way: you send signals here, they receive them there. The only dif', 'Albert Einstein', 'funny', '2021-07-16 04:02:15'),
(2409, 'Love: A temporary insanity curable by marriage.', 'Ambrose Bierce', 'love', '2021-07-16 04:02:17'),
(2410, 'Literature and the arts are also criticism in a more particular and practical sense. They embody an expository reflection on, a value judgement of, the inheritance and context to which they pertain.', 'George Steiner', 'art', '2021-07-16 04:02:19'),
(2411, 'The schoolroom clock was worn raw by stares; and you couldnt look up at the big Puritanical face of it and not feel the countless years of young eyes reflected in it, urging it onwards. It was a dark, old spirit that didnt so much mark time as bequeath it', 'Tod Wodicka', 'students', '2021-07-16 04:02:22'),
(2412, 'Twenty years from now you will be more disappointed by the things that you didnt do than by the ones you did do. So throw off the bowlines. Sail away from the safe harbor. Catch the trade winds in your sails. Explore. Dream. Discover.', 'Mark Twain', 'inspire', '2021-07-17 04:02:10'),
(2413, 'The art of leadership is saying no, not saying yes. It is very easy to say yes.', 'Tony Blair', 'management', '2021-07-17 04:02:12'),
(2414, 'Give me golf clubs, fresh air and a beautiful partner, and you can keep the clubs and the fresh air.', 'Jack Benny', 'sports', '2021-07-17 04:02:14'),
(2415, 'Vulnerability is not knowing victory or defeat, its understanding the necessity of both; its engaging. Its being all in.', 'Brene Brown', 'life', '2021-07-17 04:02:17'),
(2416, 'Once I opened up a fortune cookie and inside was the guys cheque next to me I said hey buddy I got your cheque he said thanks', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2021-07-17 04:02:19'),
(2417, 'The face of a lover is an unknown, precisely because it is invested with so much of oneself. It is a mystery, containing, like all mysteries, the possibility of torment.', 'James Arthur Baldwin', 'love', '2021-07-17 04:02:21'),
(2418, 'A poet is a bird of unearthly excellence, who escapes from his celestial realm arrives in this world warbling. If we do not cherish him, he spreads his wings and flies back into his homeland.', 'Kahlil Gibran', 'art', '2021-07-17 04:02:23'),
(2419, 'I dont know whats the matter with people: they dont learn by understanding, they learn by some other way by rote or something. Their knowledge is so fragile!', 'Richard Feynman', 'students', '2021-07-17 04:02:25'),
(2420, 'It is easy to sit up and take notice, What is difficult is getting up and taking action.', 'Honore de Balzac', 'inspire', '2021-07-18 04:01:56'),
(2421, 'Probable impossibilities are to be preferred to improbable possibilities.', 'Aristotle', 'management', '2021-07-18 04:01:59'),
(2422, 'Karate is a form of martial arts in which people who have had years and years of training can, using only their hands and feet, make some of the worst movies in the history of the world.', 'Dave Barry', 'sports', '2021-07-18 04:02:01'),
(2423, 'The art of living is more like wrestling than dancing.', 'Marcus Aurelius', 'life', '2021-07-18 04:02:03'),
(2424, 'There is only one difference between a long life and a good dinner: that, in the dinner, the sweets come last.', 'Robert Louis Stevenson', 'funny', '2021-07-18 04:02:05'),
(2425, 'The free soul is rare, but you know it when you see it - basically because you feel good, very good, when you are near or with them.', 'Charles Bukowski', 'inspire', '2021-07-19 04:02:02'),
(2426, 'Leadership is an interactive conversation that pulls people toward becoming comfortable with the language of personal responsibility and commitment.', 'John G Agno', 'management', '2021-07-19 04:02:04'),
(2427, 'As I understand it, sport is hard work for which you do not get paid.', 'Irvin S. Cobb', 'sports', '2021-07-19 04:02:07'),
(2428, 'Believe that life is worth living and your belief will help create the fact.', 'William James', 'life', '2021-07-19 04:02:09'),
(2429, 'You want a friend in Washington? Get a dog.', 'Harry S Truman', 'funny', '2021-07-19 04:02:11'),
(2430, 'Jealousy, that dragon which slays love under the pretence of keeping it alive.', 'Havelock Ellis', 'love', '2021-07-19 04:02:13'),
(2431, 'Every child is an artist. The problem is how to remain an artist once we grow up.', 'Pablo Picasso', 'art', '2021-07-19 04:02:16'),
