(2435, 'I dont know any other way to lead but by example.', 'Don Shula', 'sports', '2021-07-20 04:02:09'),
(2436, 'Perpetual inspiration is as necessary to the life of goodness, holiness and happiness as perpetual respiration is necessary to animal life.', 'Andrew Bonar Law', 'life', '2021-07-20 04:02:11'),
(2437, 'You cant succeed coming to the potluck with only a fork.', 'Dave Liniger', 'funny', '2021-07-20 04:02:13'),
(2438, 'The only way to get love is to be lovable. Its very irritating if you have a lot of money. Youd like to think you could write a check: Ill buy a million dollars worth of love. But it doesnt work that way. The more you give love away, the more you get.', 'Warren Buffett', 'love', '2021-07-20 04:02:15'),
