(2442, 'So one of the great advantages that I had in my career is I started trading 24 hours a day in my early 20s, and I had to learn to delegate to people. I had to learn to trust people, and I realized that success was going to be born in hiring really bright ', 'Ken Griffin', 'management', '2021-07-21 04:02:05'),
(2443, 'It has nothing to do with swimming. That happens to be my sport. Im trying to see how far I can go.', 'Mark Spitz', 'sports', '2021-07-21 04:02:08'),
(2444, 'Forget regret, or life is yours to miss.', 'Jonathan Larson', 'life', '2021-07-21 04:02:10'),
(2445, 'Im so mean, I make medicine sick.', 'Mohamad Ali', 'funny', '2021-07-21 04:02:12'),
(2446, 'Any time there is un-forgiveness between people who love each other, there is suffering. Any time people face challenges that they really dont understand.. There is suffering.', 'Iyanla Vanzant', 'love', '2021-07-21 04:02:14'),
