(2448, 'The educator has the duty of not being neutral.', 'Paulo Freire', 'students', '2021-07-21 04:02:19'),
(2449, 'People who are crazy enough to think they can change the world, are the ones who do.', 'Apple Computers', 'inspire', '2021-07-22 04:01:48'),
(2450, 'People ask the difference between a leader and a boss. The leader leads, and the boss drives.', 'Theodore Roosevelt', 'management', '2021-07-22 04:01:51'),
(2451, 'It is nothing new or original to say that golf is played one stroke at a time. But it took me many years to realize it.', 'Bobby Jones', 'sports', '2021-07-22 04:01:53'),
(2452, 'If you like what you do, and youre lucky enough to be good at it, do it for that reason.', 'Phil Grimshaw', 'life', '2021-07-22 04:01:55'),
