(2455, 'All art is quite useless.', 'Oscar Wilde', 'art', '2021-07-22 04:02:02'),
(2456, 'Do question, even the basics!You will be a fool for once!If you dont, you will be, for a lifetime.', 'Himmilicious', 'students', '2021-07-22 04:02:04'),
(2457, 'If you want to test your memory, try to recall what you were worrying about one year ago today.', 'E. Joseph Cossman', 'inspire', '2021-07-23 04:01:57'),
(2458, 'In the end, as a leader, you are always going to get a combination of two things: what you create and what you allow.', 'Henry Cloud', 'management', '2021-07-23 04:01:59'),
(2459, 'I always turn to the sports pages first, which records peoples accomplishments. The front page has nothing but mans failures.', 'Earl Warren', 'sports', '2021-07-23 04:02:02'),
(2460, 'I wanted to achieve something essential in life, something that is not measured by money or position in society. The mountains are not stadiums where I satisfy my ambitions to achieve. They are my cathedrals, the houses of my religion. In the mountains I ', 'Anatoli Boukreev', 'life', '2021-07-23 04:02:04'),
(2461, 'I always wanted to be somebody, but now I realize I should have been more specific.', 'Lily Tomlin', 'funny', '2021-07-23 04:02:06'),
(2462, 'All love shifts and changes. I dont know if you can be wholeheartedly in love all the time.', 'Julie Andrews', 'love', '2021-07-23 04:02:08'),
(2463, 'A piece of art is never a finished work. It answers a question which has been asked, and asks a new question.', 'Robert Engman', 'art', '2021-07-23 04:02:11'),
(2464, 'Do you want to achieve something or do you just want to make money? Asked a nearby man in a white shirt to another man in a striped shirt. I waited for the answer as I slowly walked past them. Why is it an either or question? The man in the striped shirt ', 'Daniel Amory', 'students', '2021-07-23 04:02:13'),
