(2468, 'Theres a crack (or cracks) in everyone, thats how the light of God gets in.', 'Elizabeth Gilbert', 'life', '2021-07-24 04:02:03'),
(2469, 'I came from a real tough neighborhood. In the local restaurant I sat down and had broken leg of lamb.', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2021-07-24 04:02:05'),
(2470, 'Among those whom I like or admire, I can find no common denominator, but among those whom I love, I can: all of them make me laugh.', 'W. H. Auden', 'love', '2021-07-24 04:02:08'),
(2471, 'Poetry is the art of creating imaginary gardens with real toads.', 'Marianne Moore', 'art', '2021-07-24 04:02:10'),
(2472, 'The best teachers become the best teachers by being their own best students.', 'Laurie Gray', 'students', '2021-07-24 04:02:12'),
(2473, 'Winning isnt everything.. Its the only thing.', 'Vincent van Gogh', 'inspire', '2021-07-25 04:02:11'),
(2474, 'A great leaders courage to fulfill his vision comes from passion, not position.', 'John Maxwell', 'management', '2021-07-25 04:02:13'),
(2475, 'By the time you get to your ball, if you dont know what to do with it, try another sport.', 'Julius Boros', 'sports', '2021-07-25 04:02:15'),
(2476, 'Luck is a dividend of sweat. The more you sweat, the luckier you get', 'Ray Kroc', 'inspire', '2021-07-26 04:01:59'),
(2477, 'Great leaders are pragmatists who can deal with difficult realities but still have the optimism and courage to act.', 'Nitin Nohria', 'management', '2021-07-26 04:02:01'),
(2478, 'Black people dominate sports in the United States. 20% of the population and 90% of the final four. We own this shit. Basketball, baseball, football, golf, tennis, and as soon as they make a heated hockey rink well take that shit too.', 'Chris Rock', 'sports', '2021-07-26 04:02:03'),
(2479, 'Life is a series of collisions with the future; it is not the sum of what we have been, but what we yearn to be.', 'Jose Ortega y Gasset', 'life', '2021-07-26 04:02:05'),
(2480, 'The behavior of any bureaucratic organization can best be understood by assuming that it is controlled by a secret cabal of its enemies.', 'Robert Conquest', 'funny', '2021-07-26 04:02:08'),
(2481, 'Love is not something that you can put chains on and throw into a lake. Thats called Houdini. Love is liking someone a lot.', 'Jack Handey Deep Thoughts', 'love', '2021-07-26 04:02:10'),
(2482, 'The artist is nothing without the gift, but the gift is nothing without work.', 'Emile Zola', 'art', '2021-07-26 04:02:12'),
(2483, 'Dont try to fix the students, fix ourselves first. The good teacher makes the poor student good and the good student superior. When our students fail, we, as teachers, too, have failed.', 'Marva Collins', 'students', '2021-07-26 04:02:15'),
(2484, 'The tennis ball doesnt know how old I am. The ball doesnt know if Im a man or a woman or if I come from a communist country or not. Sport has always broken down these barriers.', 'Martina Navratilova', 'inspire', '2021-07-27 04:01:57'),
(2485, 'The leadership instinct you are born with is the backbone. You develop the funny bone and the wishbone that go with it.', 'Elaine Agather', 'management', '2021-07-27 04:02:00'),
(2486, 'Love is the most important thing in the world, but baseball is pretty good, too.', 'Yogi Berra', 'sports', '2021-07-27 04:02:02'),
(2487, 'Life itself still remains a very effective therapist.', 'Karen Horney', 'life', '2021-07-27 04:02:04'),
(2488, 'Boy is my wife stupid. It takes her and hour and a half to watch 60 minutes. My daughters no bargain either. In public school she was voted most likely to conceive.', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2021-07-27 04:02:06'),
(2489, 'Physical presence provides chemical, relational, psychological and physiological effects that virtual relationships cannot. Our brains change in the presence of another person and their behavior.', 'Henry Cloud', 'love', '2021-07-27 04:02:09'),
(2490, 'An artist is never ahead of his time but most people are far behind theirs.', 'Edgard Varese', 'art', '2021-07-27 04:02:11'),
(2491, 'By starving the sensibility of our pupils we only make them easier prey to the propagandist when he comes. For famished nature will be avenged and a hard heart is no infallible protection against a soft head.', 'C.S. Lewis', 'students', '2021-07-27 04:02:13'),
(2492, 'When you win, say nothing. When you lose, say less.', 'Paul Brown', 'inspire', '2021-07-28 04:01:53'),
(2493, 'A smart man isnt necessarily one who knows all the answers, but knows where to find them.', 'Kenny Rogers', 'management', '2021-07-28 04:01:56'),
(2494, 'Anybody with ability can play in the big leagues. But to be able to trick people year in and year out the way I did, I think that was a much greater feat.', 'Bob Uecker', 'sports', '2021-07-28 04:01:58'),
(2495, 'The ability to withstand pressure is the conditioning of the mind.', 'Sola Adele', 'life', '2021-07-28 04:02:00'),
(2496, 'People always ask me, Were you funny as a child? Well, no, I was an accountant.', 'Ellen DeGeneres', 'funny', '2021-07-28 04:02:02'),
(2497, 'If you have love in your life it can make up for a great many things you lack. If you dont have it, no matter what else there is, its not enough.', 'Ann Landers', 'love', '2021-07-28 04:02:04'),
(2498, 'Art is the stored honey of the human soul, gathered on wings of misery and travail.', 'Theodore Dreiser', 'art', '2021-07-28 04:02:07'),
(2499, 'I think of the learning process of an undulation of deep learning and periods of surfacing and reflection.', 'Josh Waitzkin', 'students', '2021-07-28 04:02:09'),
(2500, 'Vulnerability is not winning or losing; its having the courage to show up and be seen when we have no control over the outcome.', 'Brene Brown', 'inspire', '2021-07-29 04:02:16'),
(2501, 'A leader is the wave pushed ahead by the ship.', 'Leo Nikolaevich Tolstoy', 'management', '2021-07-29 04:02:18'),
(2502, 'The triple is the most exciting play in baseball. Home runs win a lot of games, but I never understood why fans are so obsessed with them.', 'Hank Aaron', 'sports', '2021-07-29 04:02:20'),
(2503, 'Know whats weird? Day by day, nothing seems to change, but pretty soon.. Everything is Different.', 'Bill Watterson', 'life', '2021-07-29 04:02:23'),
(2504, 'I bought a new Japanese car, I turned on the radio.. I dont understand a word theyre saying.', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2021-07-29 04:02:25'),
(2505, 'Love is often nothing but a favorable exchange between two people who get the most of what they can expect, considering their value on the personality market.', 'Erich Fromm', 'love', '2021-07-29 04:02:27'),
(2506, 'The whole culture is telling you to hurry, while the art tells you to take your time. Always listen to the art.', 'Junot Diaz', 'art', '2021-07-29 04:02:29'),
(2507, 'The best teachers are those who show you where to look, but dont tell you what to see.', 'Alexandra K.Trenfor', 'students', '2021-07-29 04:02:31'),
(2508, 'I always advice people - Dont wait ! Do something when you are young, when you have no responsibilities. Invest time in yourself to have great Experiences that are going to enrich you, then you cant possibly lose.', 'Steve Jobs', 'inspire', '2021-07-30 04:02:16'),
(2509, 'Part of executive functions is the ability to look to a goal deadline and assess where an organization is in meeting it.', 'Henry Cloud', 'management', '2021-07-30 04:02:18'),
(2510, 'There isnt a flaw in his golf or his makeup. He will win more majors than Arnold Palmer and me combined. Somebody is going to dust my records. It might as well be Tiger, because hes such a great kid.', 'Jack Nicklaus', 'sports', '2021-07-30 04:02:20'),
(2511, 'Best thing you could probably do as a father is make sure they see how much you love their mother.', 'Matthew McConaughey', 'life', '2021-07-30 04:02:23'),
(2512, 'The four building blocks of the universe are fire, water, gravel and vinyl.', 'Dave Barry', 'funny', '2021-07-30 04:02:25'),
(2513, 'Unconditional Love Is Huge In This World.', 'Warren Buffett', 'love', '2021-07-30 04:02:27'),
(2514, 'Life is the art of drawing without an eraser.', 'John W. Gardner', 'art', '2021-07-30 04:02:29'),
(2515, 'Responsibility for learning belongs to the student, regardless of age', 'Robert Martin', 'students', '2021-07-30 04:02:31'),
(2516, 'Time to improve is limited. The clock is always on and doesnt care if you dont feel like it. Someone else does and theyre passing you by.', 'William James Moore', 'inspire', '2021-07-31 04:01:54'),
(2517, 'Effective leadership is putting first things first. Effective management is discipline, carrying it out.', 'Stephen R. Covey', 'management', '2021-07-31 04:01:56'),
(2518, 'If you watch a game, its fun. If you play it, its recreation. If you work at it, its golf.', 'Bob Hope', 'sports', '2021-07-31 04:01:58'),
(2519, 'Life is the childhood of our immortality.', 'Johann Wolfgang von Goethe', 'life', '2021-07-31 04:02:01'),
(2520, 'In my day the principal concerns of university students were sex, smoking dope, rioting and learning. Learning was something you did only when the first three werent available.', 'Bill Bryson', 'funny', '2021-07-31 04:02:03'),
(2521, 'If you want to read about love and marriage, youve got to buy two separate books.', 'Alan King', 'love', '2021-07-31 04:02:05'),
(2522, 'When I judge art, I take my painting and put it next to a God made object like a tree or flower. If it clashes, it is not art.', 'Paul Cezanne', 'art', '2021-07-31 04:02:07'),
(2523, 'I must endure, fighting the temptation simply to become slack-jawed like most of my school peers (they wish!), who will themselves into a collective, vacant, trancelike state for the duration of each class. (Although I sometimes secretly envy their abilit', 'Beth Fantaskey', 'students', '2021-07-31 04:02:09'),
(2524, 'At that point where you have decided to upgrade from aspiration to expectation and have begun to visualize an outcome, something incredibly important has happened, you have committed to the process of change.', 'Lorii Myers', 'inspire', '2021-08-01 04:02:02'),
(2525, 'The history of the world is full of men who rose to leadership, by sheer force of self-confidence, bravery and tenacity.', 'Mahatma Gandhi', 'management', '2021-08-01 04:02:05'),
(2526, 'All hockey players are bilingual. They know English and profanity.', 'Gordie Howe', 'sports', '2021-08-01 04:02:07'),
(2527, 'The main thing is to be moved, to love, to hope, to tremble, to live.', 'Auguste Rodin', 'life', '2021-08-01 04:02:09'),
(2528, 'Painting, n.: The art of protecting flat surfaces from the weather, and exposing them to the critic.', 'Ambrose Bierce', 'funny', '2021-08-01 04:02:11'),
(2529, 'To resist the frigidity of old age, one must combine the body, the mind, and the heart. And to keep these in parallel vigor one must exercise, study, and love.', 'Alan Bleasdale', 'love', '2021-08-01 04:02:14'),
(2530, 'Art is when you hear a knocking from your soul and you answer.', 'Terri Guillemets', 'art', '2021-08-01 04:02:16'),
(2531, 'The worst thing a kid can say about homework is that it is too hard. The worst thing a kid can say about a game is its too easy.', 'Henry Jenkins', 'students', '2021-08-01 04:02:18'),
(2532, 'Meaning is something you build into your life. You build it out of your own past, out of your affections and loyalties, out of the experience of humankind as it is passed on to you... You are the only one who can put them together into that unique pattern', 'John Gardner', 'inspire', '2021-08-02 04:02:07'),
(2533, 'Leaders must be close enough to relate to others, but far enough ahead to motivate them.', 'John C. Maxwell', 'management', '2021-08-02 04:02:09'),
(2534, 'I dont want to play golf. When I hit a ball, I want someone else to go chase it.', 'Rogers Hornsby', 'sports', '2021-08-02 04:02:11'),
(2535, 'Dont shy away from earning, but dont sell away your soul.', 'Shah Rukh Khan', 'life', '2021-08-02 04:02:13'),
(2536, 'Why her cooking is so bad that the flies pitched in to fix the screen door. I leave dental floss in the kitchen and watch the roaches hang themselves.', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'funny', '2021-08-02 04:02:16'),
(2537, 'Basically, when you get to my age, youll really measure your success in life by how many of the people you want to have love you actually do love you.', 'Warren Buffett', 'love', '2021-08-02 04:02:18'),
(2538, 'I am enough of an artist to draw freely upon my imagination. Imagination is more important than knowledge. Knowledge is limited. Imagination encircles the world.', 'Albert Einstein', 'art', '2021-08-02 04:02:20'),
(2539, 'It is said, in a fire, everyone runs away from it save for the fireman who run towards it. When dealing with students, be the fireman.', 'Patricia Sequeira Belvel', 'students', '2021-08-02 04:02:22'),
(2540, 'Sustenance! Your health is always the best prescription.', 'Lorii Myers', 'inspire', '2021-08-03 04:02:03'),
(2541, 'Leaders set a very clear path every day, in a thousand different ways, of what the people must attend to, inhibit, and keep it current in front of them.', 'Henry Cloud', 'management', '2021-08-03 04:02:05'),
(2542, 'But more importantly, youve got to play with your heart, with every fiber of your body. If youre lucky enough to find a guy with a lot of head and a lot of heart, hes never going to come off the field second.', 'Vince Lombardi', 'sports', '2021-08-03 04:02:07'),
(2543, 'Life is a continuous exercise in creative problem solving.', 'Michael J. Gelb', 'life', '2021-08-03 04:02:09'),
(2544, 'The best measure of a mans honesty isnt his income tax return. Its the zero adjust on his bathroom scale.', 'Arthur C. Clarke', 'funny', '2021-08-03 04:02:12'),
(2545, 'A hug is like a boomerang you get it back right away.', 'Bil Keane', 'love', '2021-08-03 04:02:14'),
(2546, 'The arts babblative and scribblative.', 'Robert Southey', 'art', '2021-08-03 04:02:16'),
(2547, 'The chief wonder of education is that it does not ruin everybody concerned in it, teachers and taught.', 'Henry Adams', 'students', '2021-08-03 04:02:18');
